Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.20,0:01:10.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以 我知道你们在想什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}So… I know what you're thinking.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.12,0:01:13.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么这个巨帅的刺猬\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why is that incredibly handsome hedgehog.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.40,0:01:16.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,会被一个南北战争时期来的疯狂胡子男追\N{\fnArial\fs30}being chased by a mad man with a mustache from the civil war?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.15,0:01:20.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,老实说 感觉就像我一生都在奔跑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gotta be honest, it feels like I've been running my whole life.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.95,0:01:23.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,信息量太大了吗 我说得太快了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is this too much? Am I going too fast?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.49,0:01:26.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,这像是我做的 这样吧 我们往回倒\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's kinda what I do. You know what? Let's back up.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.40,0:01:36.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,这座岛是我的家乡\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is the island where I am from.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.87,0:01:41.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,岛上什么都有 沙滩 瀑布\N{\fnArial\fs30}It had everything: sandy beaches, cascading waterfalls,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.85,0:01:43.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,每个人都能玩的大回环\N{\fnArial\fs30}public access to loop-de-loops.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.93,0:01:45.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我从来不需要坐校车\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I never had to catch a school bus.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.89,0:01:48.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我能在两秒内\N{\fnArial\fs30}because I can run across the entire island.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.26,0:01:49.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,跑遍整个岛\N{\fnArial\fs30}in less than two seconds.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.93,0:01:51.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且也没有学校\N{\fnArial\fs30}Also, there was no school.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.87,0:01:54.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道 这是个很不错的岛 对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know, pretty sweet island, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.31,0:01:58.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我生来就具有超能力\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was born with extraordinary powers,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.03,0:01:59.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们让我隐藏这些能力\N{\fnArial\fs30}and was told to keep them in secret.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.84,0:02:02.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,和其他孩子一样 我做了完全相反的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}And like any kid, I did the exact opposite.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.09,0:02:07.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是长爪鸟 她照顾我\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's Longclaw, she took care of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.75,0:02:10.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,她基本上就是欧比王·肯诺比\N{\fnArial\fs30}She was basically Obi-Wan Kenobi,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.15,0:02:12.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果欧比王·肯诺比长鸟嘴并吃老鼠的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}if Obi-Wan Kenobi had a beak and ate mice.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.57,0:02:14.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,索尼克 有人可能会看到你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sonic, someone could've seen you!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.10,0:02:17.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,没人看见我 我跑得太快了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No one saw me. I am too fast!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.95,0:02:20.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想把这个送给你\N{\fnArial\fs30}And, I wanted to bring you this.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.68,0:02:25.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,趴下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get down!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.46,0:02:30.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,事实证明 超能力\N{\fnArial\fs30}Turns out with great power.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.17,0:02:32.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,总会招来渴望得到超能力的坏蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}comes great power-hungry bad guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.50,0:02:34.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,而我把他们引来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I let them right to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.03,0:02:50.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,仔细听我说 索尼克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen carefully, Sonic.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.57,0:02:54.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有一种我从未见过的能力\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have a power unlike anything I've ever seen.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.70,0:02:57.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,这意味着总有人想得到它\N{\fnArial\fs30}And that means someone will always want it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.41,0:03:01.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,唯一保持安全的办法就是躲起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}The only way to stay safe is to stay hidden.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.35,0:03:07.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个星球在宇宙的最远处\N{\fnArial\fs30}This world is on the farthest side of the universe.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.34,0:03:08.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在那里会安全的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You should be safe there.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.60,0:03:11.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你不走我也不走 - 你必须走\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I don't wanna go without you! - You must!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.47,0:03:14.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些戒指将是你最重要的财产\N{\fnArial\fs30}These rings will be your most important possession.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.04,0:03:20.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你被发现了 就用一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you ever discovered, use one.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.92,0:03:23.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,永远不要停止奔跑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Never stop running.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.60,0:03:24.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在 快走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now go!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.81,0:03:30.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,长爪鸟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Longclaw!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.53,0:03:33.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 再见 索尼克 - 不要\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Goodbye, Sonic. - No!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.59,0:03:37.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.83,0:03:49.20,Title,0,0,0,0,,《刺猬索尼克》
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.51,0:03:55.89,Note,0,0,0,0,,（蒙大拿州 青山镇 十年后）
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.89,0:03:59.43,Note,0,0,0,0,,（青山镇警察局）
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.33,0:04:05.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托 一辆车都没有吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, one car?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.56,0:04:16.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,好无聊\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm bored.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.76,0:04:18.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,汤姆 能听到我说话吗 你在吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tom, do you read me? Are you there?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.78,0:04:22.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 韦德 我在巴巴多斯的一艘游艇上\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, Wade, I'm actually on a yacht in Barbados.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.86,0:04:24.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,和蕾哈娜在一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}with Rihanna.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.41,0:04:27.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊 太了厉害了 请发照片\N{\fnArial\fs30}OMG. That's amazing, please send pics.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.66,0:04:29.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 韦德 我在测速区\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, Wade, I'm at the speed trap.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.80,0:04:31.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,已经在那里了吗 你怎么回来得这么快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Already? How did you get back so fast?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.96,0:04:33.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,巴巴多斯在海上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Barbados is in the ocean.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.43,0:04:35.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,稍等 我想我发现了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hang on, I think I got something.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.95,0:04:44.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,伙计 这么着急干嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, buddy, where's the fire?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.03,0:04:47.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,这附近住着孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've got kids living around here.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.25,0:04:50.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,这挺有趣的 抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was kinda funny, sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.48,0:04:58.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.09,0:05:38.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,汤姆 我们需要你到中央大街来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tom, we need you down on Main Street.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.99,0:05:41.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里有帮派火拼\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's been a violent gang shoot-out.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.92,0:05:45.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,开玩笑的 有只狗偷了个面包圈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just kidding, a dog stole a bagel.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.44,0:05:47.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,但他们确实需要支援\N{\fnArial\fs30}But they do need it back.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.95,0:06:01.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,伙计 你刚才差点被撞死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Buddy, you almost got yourself killed out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.54,0:06:03.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是谁 某些玩的就是心跳党吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you, some kind of an adrenaline junkie?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.65,0:06:05.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,一直这么慢肯定很难过吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Must be rough being slow all the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.80,0:06:09.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道吗 今天是你的幸运日\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll tell you what, today is your lucky day.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.46,0:06:15.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,你以前感到过如此有活力吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have you ever felt so alive?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.11,0:06:19.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,真棒 你做得太好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is great, you're doing amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.95,0:06:21.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, jeez!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.78,0:06:24.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,挽救成功\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good recovery!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.66,0:06:28.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,保守这个小秘密 好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's keep this our little secret, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.04,0:06:32.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你从没见过我 我从没来过这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}You never saw me. I was never here.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.66,0:06:48.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以 你之前在期待些什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what were you expecting?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.56,0:06:50.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,一只肮脏的小刺猬吃着浆果\N{\fnArial\fs30}A dirty little hedgehog eating berries,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.35,0:06:52.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,挣扎着活下去吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}and struggling to survive?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.33,0:06:53.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,再想想\N{\fnArial\fs30}Think again,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.15,0:06:56.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我在地球上过着最好的生活\N{\fnArial\fs30}because I am living my best life on Earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.93,0:06:58.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有座图书馆\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've got a library.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.25,0:07:01.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个家庭健身房\N{\fnArial\fs30}A home gym.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.87,0:07:04.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有最先进的安保系统\N{\fnArial\fs30}And a state of the art security system.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.25,0:07:13.54,Note,0,0,0,0,,（山顶路 下个出口）
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.92,0:07:18.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,不会吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.16,0:07:22.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我被发现了 我会按长爪鸟告诉我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}And if I ever discovered, I'll follow Longclaw's instructions,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.41,0:07:24.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,用我的戒指逃去一个新的星球\N{\fnArial\fs30}and use my rings to escape to a new planet.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.46,0:07:29.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个只有蘑菇的 美丽安全的小星球\N{\fnArial\fs30}A nice, safe little world filled only with mushrooms.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.83,0:07:33.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,令人恶心的 臭臭的蘑菇\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gross, smelly mushrooms…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.84,0:07:36.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我讨厌蘑菇\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hate mushrooms.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.79,0:07:39.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,但不要担心这些\N{\fnArial\fs30}But let's not worry about all of that.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.94,0:07:42.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里是青山镇\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is Green Hills.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.60,0:07:44.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,地球上最棒的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}The greatest place on Earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.89,0:07:48.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些是我的朋友 在那里 我觉得\N{\fnArial\fs30}These are my people, and there, I say,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.58,0:07:50.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是他们可爱的太空生物\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am their lovable space creature.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.87,0:07:53.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以如果他们不知道我的存在会怎样\N{\fnArial\fs30}So what if they don't know I exist?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.55,0:07:57.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我最喜欢的人是甜甜圈殿下\N{\fnArial\fs30}My favorite person is the Donut Lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.74,0:08:00.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,他保护这个镇\N{\fnArial\fs30}Protector of this town,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.96,0:08:04.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,是所有大小生物的保护者\N{\fnArial\fs30}and defender of all creatures, big and small.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.30,0:08:06.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,早上好 唐纳德 黛西 达菲.\N{\fnArial\fs30}Morning, Donald, Daisy, Daffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.07,0:08:10.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,甜甜圈殿下和椒盐卷饼夫人住在一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}Donut Lord lives with Pretzel Lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.29,0:08:13.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,她对动物超级友善\N{\fnArial\fs30}She is super nice to animals,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.02,0:08:15.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,奇怪的是她天生特别柔软\N{\fnArial\fs30}and strangely was born without bones.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.54,0:08:21.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,镇上有个人实际上已经发现了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is one person in town who's actually onto me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.79,0:08:23.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,他称我为蓝恶魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}He calls me The Blue Devil.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.00,0:08:25.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我昨晚差点就抓住他了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I almost caught him last night.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.74,0:08:27.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,和疯狂的卡尔打个招呼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Say hello to Crazy Carl.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.10,0:08:33.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们在一起很开心\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have fun together.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.61,0:08:36.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你在那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know you're out there!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.15,0:08:39.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你是真实的\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I know you're real!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.24,0:08:42.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I'm not.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.79,0:08:45.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,电影之夜是我的最爱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Movie night is my favorite.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.18,0:08:46.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托 拜托了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please, please…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.20,0:08:50.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,太好了 基努 你就是国宝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes! Keanu, you are a national treasure.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.44,0:08:52.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 一旦我找到你 - 快问快答\N{\fnArial\fs30}- When I find you… - Pop quiz, hot-shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.99,0:08:54.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,公交车上有枚炸弹\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's a bomb on the bus.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.68,0:08:57.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,「快问快答」 真是经典台词\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Pop quiz, hot-shot." The classic line.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.58,0:09:00.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,基本上 我们就像是一家人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Basically, we're like a family,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.11,0:09:02.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,尽管我们从未见过面\N{\fnArial\fs30}even though we haven't met yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.02,0:09:05.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不觉得长期一个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't think your prolonged isolation.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.44,0:09:07.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,可能会让你变的有点神经吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}is making you a bit crazy perhaps?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.09,0:09:10.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,发疯 我吗 不可能 医生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crazy? Me? No way, Doc.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.74,0:09:12.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,你误会我了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got me all wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.75,0:09:15.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,尽管你有这些所谓的朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}And despite all these so called friends of yours,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.77,0:09:18.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,但在内心深处你还是非常孤独 对吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}deep down you are still rather lonely?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.52,0:09:27.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许你害怕自己会永远一个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Perhaps afraid you'll be alone forever?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.40,0:09:45.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 别吃垃圾\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey! No, no…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.15,0:09:49.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,快走 快点 快 走开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get out of there! Come on! Oh, come on! Get out of there!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.23,0:09:52.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,走开 你们这些浣熊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get out of there, you trash pandas!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.18,0:09:56.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,玛蒂 作为青山镇最受尊敬的兽医\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maddie, as Green Hills most respected veterinary,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.03,0:09:59.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,请问消灭浣熊最快的方法是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}what is the fastest way to exterminate a racoon?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.20,0:10:02.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好 奥兹 看见我你很开心吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi, Ozzy. Hello. You're glad to see me?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.89,0:10:04.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不吃垃圾 对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't eat garbage, do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.86,0:10:06.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.75,0:10:07.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我认为的那个东西吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that what I think it is?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.51,0:10:09.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 拆开吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah ha. Open it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.65,0:10:14.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 有点薄 不太好吗 - 打开\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's kinda small, is that bad? - Just… open it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.93,0:10:22.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,亲爱的托马斯 我们已经审查过\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dear Thomas, we have reviewed your application.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.13,0:10:23.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,你向旧金山警察局递交的申请\N{\fnArial\fs30}to the San Francisco Police Department,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.98,0:10:26.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,目前正等待部门间审查和背景调查\N{\fnArial\fs30}and pending inter departmental review and background check.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.66,0:10:27.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们很高兴地通知你\N{\fnArial\fs30}And we are happy to inform you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.94,0:10:29.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,你被选中加入我们的警队\N{\fnArial\fs30}that you have been selected to join our team.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.90,0:10:32.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 天啊 - 天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Oh my God! - Wow! Oh my God!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.72,0:10:37.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,旧金山糟透了\N{\fnArial\fs30}San Francisco sucks?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.69,0:10:41.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,拿错了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wrong one.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.88,0:10:44.88,Note,0,0,0,0,,（恭喜 我从没怀疑过你的能力）
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.82,0:10:47.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你从没怀疑过我的能力吗 - 没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You never had a doubt, huh? - No!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.98,0:10:54.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我真不敢相信 - 我知道 你做到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I can't believe this! - I know. You did it!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.75,0:10:57.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are those?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.41,0:11:00.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在住乐上找到的正在出租的公寓\N{\fnArial\fs30}Apartments for rent I found on Zillow.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.98,0:11:03.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得我和奥兹明天就能坐飞机过去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I though Ozzy and I can fly there tomorrow,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.81,0:11:06.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,到附近看看\N{\fnArial\fs30}and check out some neighborhoods.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.72,0:11:08.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,这一切发生得太快了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, this is all happening so fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.13,0:11:12.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊 这是最疯狂的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Man, it's the craziest thing,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.15,0:11:14.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,你申请了这份工作 然后被录用了\N{\fnArial\fs30}you apply for the job, you get the job.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.02,0:11:16.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,还要等背景审查\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, pending a background check.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.12,0:11:18.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊 希望他们没发现\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, man, hope they don't find out about.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.41,0:11:20.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,你当时用的是邻居的WiFi\N{\fnArial\fs30}that time you used the neighbor's WiFi.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.12,0:11:23.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,更正一下 我现在还在用邻居的WiFi\N{\fnArial\fs30}Correction, I'm still using the neighbor's WiFi.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.98,0:11:25.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是 玛蒂\N{\fnArial\fs30}But, Maddie…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.59,0:11:27.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,你确定你愿意这样做吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you sure you're okay with this?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.46,0:11:29.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,托马斯 米歇尔 瓦查斯基\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thomas Michael Wachowski,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.14,0:11:31.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在兽医学校读书期间你做过什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}what did you do the entire time I was in a veterinary school?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.79,0:11:33.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我打了第二份工来付房租\N{\fnArial\fs30}I worked the second job to pay the rent, and…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.89,0:11:35.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,打了第三份工来付我的学费\N{\fnArial\fs30}A third job to pay tuition.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.95,0:11:39.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,你曾为我牺牲 现在我很高兴为你牺牲\N{\fnArial\fs30}You sacrificed for me, I'm happy to sacrifice for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.92,0:11:43.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,亲爱的 你确定你愿意这样做吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Babe, are you sure you're okay with this?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.61,0:11:45.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,瓦查斯基家族的成员\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, there's been a Wachowski.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.98,0:11:48.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,保护这个小镇已经有五十年多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}protecting this town for more than 50 years.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.86,0:11:51.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是个巨大的改变\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is a big change.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.37,0:11:53.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我愿意\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm positive.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.92,0:11:57.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,到了我离开这里证明自己的时候了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's time for this guy to get out there and prove himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.46,0:11:59.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我爱青山镇 但是\N{\fnArial\fs30}I love Green Hills, but…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.46,0:12:01.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我希望帮助那些真正有困难人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, I wanna help people in real trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.12,0:12:04.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我希望有人在生死关头向我求助\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want someone to turn to me in a life-or-death situation,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.04,0:12:06.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,而我会尽力帮他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I'll be there for them.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.26,0:12:11.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我明白了 我以你为荣 - 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I get it. I'm so proud of you. - Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.05,0:12:14.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,怀着沉重的心情\N{\fnArial\fs30}And so it is with a heavy heart,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.34,0:12:16.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我向你们宣布 我已接受了\N{\fnArial\fs30}that I tell you all that I've accepted a position.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.43,0:12:20.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,旧金山警察局的工作 立即生效\N{\fnArial\fs30}at the San Francisco Police Department, effective immediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.44,0:12:23.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,离开我的家乡和我所有的朋友会很艰难\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's gonna be tough to leave my hometown, and all my friendships.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.25,0:12:27.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我觉得有些事我必须去做\N{\fnArial\fs30}But this is something I feel like I need to do,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.04,0:12:32.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,作为警官和男人 我需要成长\N{\fnArial\fs30}to grow, as both an officer, and a man.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.79,0:12:37.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得怎么样 彩针巡佐\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you think, Sergeant Sprinkles?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.52,0:12:40.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,说得不赖 对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}That wasn't so bad, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.63,0:12:43.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我现在要做的就是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now all I gotta do is…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.15,0:12:45.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉除甜甜圈以外的所有人\N{\fnArial\fs30}tell everyone who isn't a donut.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.10,0:12:50.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,是季后赛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoa, the play-offs.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.06,0:13:36.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,真酷\N{\fnArial\fs30}So cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.21,0:13:42.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,第九局下半场 平分\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bottom of the ninth, tie score.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.77,0:13:44.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,接下来的比赛中\N{\fnArial\fs30}And exactly who you want at the plate.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.75,0:13:46.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,你希望跑垒员是谁 是索尼克\N{\fnArial\fs30}with the game on the line, Sonic.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.52,0:13:48.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,但在投手区盯着他的\N{\fnArial\fs30}But staring him down from the pitcher's mound.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.60,0:13:52.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,是青山镇最可怕的左撇子 也是索尼克\N{\fnArial\fs30}is the most fearsome southpaw in Green Hills, also Sonic.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.11,0:13:54.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 集中注意力 索尼克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, focus, Sonic.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.55,0:13:55.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果赢了这场比赛\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you win this game.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.36,0:13:58.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就是青山镇最受欢迎的孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}you'll be the most beloved kid in Green Hills.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.00,0:14:03.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,把球打到左边的那个家伙那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hit it to the guy in left,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.74,0:14:05.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,他真的很蠢\N{\fnArial\fs30}he's a real space case.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.94,0:14:10.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我真受不了那个家伙\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't with that guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.74,0:14:12.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,击球手索尼克 击球手索尼克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, batter Sonic, hey, batter Sonic,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.08,0:14:14.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,专注的击球手索尼克\N{\fnArial\fs30}is so in batter Sonic.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.25,0:14:23.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来接 我来接\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got it, I got it…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.90,0:14:26.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没接到\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.04,0:14:37.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,回本垒 回本垒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go home! Go home!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.58,0:14:39.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.08,0:14:45.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,安全上垒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Safe!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.47,0:14:49.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,太好了 我做到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes! Yes! I did it!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.09,0:14:52.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看到了吗 我做到了 做到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you see that? I did it! I did it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.00,0:15:08.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我真的只是一个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I really am alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.58,0:15:11.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,永远只有我自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}All alone. Forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.42,0:15:46.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我敢肯定 没人注意到\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sure no one noticed.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.47,0:15:48.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个蓝色的大爆炸 对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}that giant blue explosion, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.22,0:15:59.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂 韦德\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Wade.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.86,0:16:01.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好 汤姆 我是韦德\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi, Tom. Wade here.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.60,0:16:04.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,发生什么事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.41,0:16:06.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 天啊 我想停电了 - 对 蠢货\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Oh Gosh, I think the power is out. - Yap, dur.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.93,0:16:09.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,灯全熄了 全镇人都吓坏了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The lights are out. The whole town is freaking out.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.85,0:16:11.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我该怎么办 - 好吧 放松\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What should I do? - Okay. Relax.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.67,0:16:13.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,深呼吸 给吉尔打电话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take a deep breath, call Gil,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.63,0:16:15.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看他们是否能找到下游线路 然后\N{\fnArial\fs30}see if they can locate the down line, then…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.63,0:16:18.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,给齐姆打电话 看他能否把他的发电机\N{\fnArial\fs30}call Zim, and see if he can get his generator over.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.46,0:16:20.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,送去超级线索咖啡 这样食物就能保持新鲜\N{\fnArial\fs30}to the Super Cue, so the food stays fresh.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.84,0:16:24.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,先打给齐姆 再给吉尔打吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Call Zim before Gil?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.98,0:16:26.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 打给吉尔 喂 - 等会回给你\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Call Gil… - Hello? I'll call you back.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.68,0:16:29.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 别挂 就这么挂掉了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait. Wait! Hello? Was that the end of the instructions?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.11,0:16:33.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,行 好的 你能做到的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. All right. You can do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.62,0:16:37.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,他说首先要干什么来着\N{\fnArial\fs30}What was the first thing he said to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.41,0:16:41.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 放松\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right. Relax.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.78,0:17:04.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,二十分钟前 一次能量震荡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Twenty minutes ago an energy surge.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.13,0:17:07.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,让整个太平洋西北地区全面停电\N{\fnArial\fs30}knocked our power across the entire Pacific Northwest.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.09,0:17:07.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,对此我们了解些什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do we know?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.60,0:17:09.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的第一反应是 这是电磁脉冲炸弹\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our first instinct was it was an EMP.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.73,0:17:13.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,但电磁脉冲没有那么大的能量\N{\fnArial\fs30}But electromagnetic pulses don't have that kind of power.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.65,0:17:14.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,美国宇航局已排除\N{\fnArial\fs30}NASA has ruled out.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.77,0:17:16.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,流星撞击或太阳耀斑的可能性\N{\fnArial\fs30}meteor strikes or solar flares.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.23,0:17:19.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,能源部说不是电厂故障\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Department of Energy says it's not a power plant malfunction.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.27,0:17:22.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,听上去我们很擅长弄明白它不是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sounds like we're really good at figuring out what it wasn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.23,0:17:24.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,这可能是更大规模攻击的前奏\N{\fnArial\fs30}This could be a prelude to a larger attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.46,0:17:26.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我建议抽调第五团和第六团\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm suggesting we scramble the fifth and sixth regiment.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.40,0:17:27.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,不不不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.84,0:17:30.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,这需要一个更复杂的头脑\N{\fnArial\fs30}This needs a much more sophisticated mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.36,0:17:32.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个懂技术的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Someone who understands technology.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.18,0:17:33.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想派一个科学家\N{\fnArial\fs30}You wanna send in a lab rat?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.24,0:17:34.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是随便一个科学家\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not just any lab rat.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.03,0:17:36.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个真正厉害的科学家\N{\fnArial\fs30}A lab rat with teeth.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.29,0:17:38.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说的不会是我想的那个人吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not suggesting who I think you're suggesting.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.82,0:17:40.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我知道他有些奇怪 - 奇怪\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I know he's a little weird… - Weird?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.85,0:17:43.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不 不可能 - 他是个变态\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No, no. No way! - He's a psychological tire fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.44,0:17:46.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,但他相当聪明 5个博士学位 智商超高\N{\fnArial\fs30}But he's also brilliant. Five PhDs. IQ off the charts.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.91,0:17:49.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的无人机技术是革命性的\N{\fnArial\fs30}And his drone tech is revolutionary.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.69,0:17:51.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,你确定他可以处理吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're sure he can handle this?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.55,0:17:53.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,他有完美的实操经历\N{\fnArial\fs30}He has a perfect operations record.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.71,0:17:55.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 还记得巴基斯坦的政变吗 - 不记得\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Remember the coup in Pakistan? - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.75,0:17:57.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,或者阿塞拜疆斯坦的起义\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or the uprising in Azerbaijanistan?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.30,0:17:58.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,那根本就不是个国家\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not even a country.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.61,0:18:01.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 为此你应该感谢罗伯特尼克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Exactly. And you can thank Robotnik for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.74,0:18:05.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,不敢相信你竟然让那个怪人参与进来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't believe you're bringing that freak into this.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.26,0:18:07.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也不敢相信 但是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Neither can I, but…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.94,0:18:09.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们别无选择\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have no choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.63,0:18:19.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,伙子们 快过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guys, coming up!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.65,0:18:22.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 长官\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, Major.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.35,0:18:36.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是\N{\fnArial\fs30}What a…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.94,0:18:59.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,是你负责这里吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you in charge here?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.38,0:19:01.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是的 - 不 错了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yes, I am. - No. Wrong!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.96,0:19:03.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 名字 - 我负责\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Name… - I'm in charge!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.39,0:19:04.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我 - 是少校\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Me! - Is Major…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.90,0:19:06.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 本 - 我负责\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Ben… - I'm in charge.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.97,0:19:10.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,你之前没见过这种东西吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've never seen anything like this before?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.32,0:19:11.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,它告诉我\N{\fnArial\fs30}It says I'm a top banana.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.84,0:19:14.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是一群饥饿猴子中的香蕉\N{\fnArial\fs30}in a world full of hungry little monkeys.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.79,0:19:16.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,请允许我说明一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Allow me to clarify.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.09,0:19:18.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,在一个按重要性等级排列的\N{\fnArial\fs30}In a sequentially ranked hierarchy based on.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.91,0:19:20.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,层次结构中\N{\fnArial\fs30}level of critical importance.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.15,0:19:23.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们之间差距太大无法量化 斯通特工\N{\fnArial\fs30}the disparity between us is too vast to quantify. Agent Stone.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.37,0:19:24.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,博士觉得你是最底层\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Doctor thinks you're basic.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.09,0:19:26.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我正在启动一个扫描序列\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm initiating a sweep sequence.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.20,0:19:29.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,每个方向十英里应该足够了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ten miles in every direction should suffice.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.67,0:19:32.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他还在用奇怪的眼神看我吗 - 是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Is he still looking at me funny? - Yes, he is.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.78,0:19:34.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,让他不要这么看我 否则我去查他的记录\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell him to stop or I'll pull out his search history.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.02,0:19:35.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,假如你还这么看着他\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you don't stop looking, the Doctor,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.98,0:19:37.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,他会仔细看看你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}he'll take a closer look…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.71,0:19:40.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我没聋 - 告诉他现在他的人都向我报告\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm not deaf. - And tell him his men report to me now.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.65,0:19:44.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,打扰一下 我不知道你是否意识到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me? Listen, pal, I don't know if you realize…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.58,0:19:46.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起 少校 你叫什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry, Major, what was your name?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.40,0:19:49.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 本宁 - 没有人关心\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Benning… - Nobody cares! Nobody cares.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.14,0:19:52.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,听好 没人关心少校\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen, Major Nobodycares.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.49,0:19:54.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道为什么没人关心你是谁吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know why nobody cares who you are?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.91,0:19:57.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为没人关心你的一点点成就\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because nobody cares about your feeble accomplishments.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.79,0:20:00.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,没人关心你妈妈因为你读三年级\N{\fnArial\fs30}And nobody cares about how proud your Mommy is.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.42,0:20:02.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,有多骄傲\N{\fnArial\fs30}that you're now reading at a third grade level.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.57,0:20:04.89,Title,0,0,0,0,,你看完《夏洛特的网》了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have you finished 'Charlotte's Web' yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.22,0:20:07.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,剧透警告 她最终死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Spoiler alert, she dies in the end.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.69,0:20:10.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,但她留下了一个瘆人的卵囊\N{\fnArial\fs30}But she leaves a big creepy egg sac.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.94,0:20:14.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的宝贝们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my babies.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.83,0:20:17.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看我的卵囊里出来了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look what came out of my egg sac.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.41,0:20:19.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道我喜欢机器哪一点吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what I love about machines?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.42,0:20:23.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们遵循程序 让它们干什么就干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}They do what they're told. They follow their programming.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.74,0:20:25.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们不需要休假去喝酒\N{\fnArial\fs30}They don't need time-off to get drunk,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.82,0:20:27.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,或者划船\N{\fnArial\fs30}and put the boat in the water.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.73,0:20:29.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我让你做什么你就做什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you do what you're told.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.80,0:20:32.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,站在那边深渊的边缘\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stand over there on the edge of your personal abyss.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.35,0:20:35.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,看着我的机器做你们工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}And watch my machines do your job.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.21,0:20:39.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,你感受到了吗 斯通\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you feel it, Stone?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.67,0:20:41.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我感受到了 博士\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can feel it, Doctor.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.39,0:20:42.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是革命 斯通\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's evolution, Stone.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.34,0:20:46.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是革命\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's evolution!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.65,0:21:02.82,Note,0,0,0,0,,（扫描）
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.82,0:21:05.26,Note,0,0,0,0,,（数据异常）
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.03,0:21:08.49,Note,0,0,0,0,,（初始化 光谱分析）
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.49,0:21:09.08,Note,0,0,0,0,,（完成）
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.28,0:21:10.33,Note,0,0,0,0,,（初始化 矿物成分）
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.36,0:21:23.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 斯通特工 - 博士\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Agent Stone? - Doctor.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.96,0:21:26.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在这张图像里有看到任何有用的信息吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you see anything useful in this image?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.06,0:21:29.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 没有 博士 - 你当然看不出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Nothing at all, Doctor. - Of course you don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.81,0:21:31.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的眼睛没有被美国本土暗影狼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your eyes weren't expertly trained to spot tracks.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.96,0:21:34.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,专业训练来发现痕迹\N{\fnArial\fs30}by the Native American Shadow Wolves.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.35,0:21:45.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,太厉害了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's extraordinary.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.08,0:21:48.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 厉害的是\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, what extraordinary is…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.42,0:21:50.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我确定了这个生物准确的身高体重\N{\fnArial\fs30}I determined the exact height, weight,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.43,0:21:52.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,和脊柱弯曲度\N{\fnArial\fs30}and spinal curvature of this creature.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.26,0:21:55.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我的电脑不能在地球上的任何生物中\N{\fnArial\fs30}And my computer can't find a single match for it, anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.47,0:21:57.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,找到与之匹配的\N{\fnArial\fs30}in Earth's animal kingdom.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.00,0:22:00.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,这次断电不是恐怖袭击\N{\fnArial\fs30}This blackout was not a terrorist attack,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.50,0:22:02.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个也不是婴儿大脚怪\N{\fnArial\fs30}and that's no baby Bigfoot.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.84,0:22:09.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个是完全不同的一种东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}This guy is something else entirely.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.70,0:22:12.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,让所有搜寻部队都去寻找脚印\N{\fnArial\fs30}Divert all search units to the site of the footprint.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.10,0:22:15.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是人类的一小步\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's one small step for man,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.70,0:22:18.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,却是我的一大步\N{\fnArial\fs30}one giant leap for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.36,0:22:31.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事 没事 一切都好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, okay. Everything is fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.47,0:22:33.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,你玩了一会儿棒球 有一些沮丧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You played some baseball, got a little upset.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.67,0:22:36.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,发出了一道闪电 现在他们来找你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lightning shut out of your butt, and now they're coming for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.56,0:22:39.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 好吧 地球不再安全了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, all right. Earth isn't safe anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.75,0:22:42.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,该用方案B了 蘑菇村 我得拿上东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Time for plan B, Mushroomville. I gotta take my stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.68,0:22:44.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,只带重要物品\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, essential items only.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.71,0:22:47.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,牙刷 牙膏 发胶 夜灯 滑稽的帽子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, toothbrush, toothpaste, hair gel, night light, funny hat.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.85,0:22:50.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,吃了一半的哈密瓜 和香味蜡烛\N{\fnArial\fs30}This half-eaten cantaloupe, and my scented candle.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.07,0:22:52.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我所有的漫画书收藏\N{\fnArial\fs30}My entire comic book collection.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.82,0:22:54.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,豆袋椅 豆袋椅能放进背包里吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bean bag chair, can a bean bag chair fit in the backpack?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.64,0:22:57.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,不不 当然不行 太愚蠢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no. Of course not. That's stupid.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.24,0:23:00.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有什么 戒指 戒指 当然\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, what else? The rings! The rings, yes, of course!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.87,0:23:05.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,开始吧 戒指穿越 蘑菇星球我来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here we go. Ring time. Mushroom planet, here I come.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.92,0:23:08.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,不好了 他们就在外面 我得去其他地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, no! They're right outside, I gotta go somewhere else.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.72,0:23:15.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,再见 山洞\N{\fnArial\fs30}Goodbye, cave.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.57,0:23:21.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 嗨 - 嘿\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hi. - Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.23,0:23:22.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.42,0:23:25.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,与乔乔和雷切尔一起画画\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just coloring with Jojo and Rachel.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.51,0:23:27.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,听上去有一点有趣\N{\fnArial\fs30}That sounds half-fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.31,0:23:29.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,这儿有有趣的事情 我们断电了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, exciting stuff here. We had a power outage.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.77,0:23:31.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,整个城镇都黑了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The whole town went dark.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.70,0:23:33.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,像是一个信号告诉我要离开道奇\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was like a sign telling me to get outta Dodge.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.91,0:23:35.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 韦德肯定疯了 - 是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Wade must've lost his mind. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.12,0:23:38.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,他也没什么别的本事\N{\fnArial\fs30}And he does not have much to lose.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.27,0:23:40.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,你姐姐怎么样 她有没有劝说你离开我\N{\fnArial\fs30}How's your sister? Does she convince you to leave me yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.98,0:23:44.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有 但她让我检查你手机上的交友软件\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, but she did tell me to check your phone for dating apps.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.45,0:23:46.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我手机上的软件都是自带的\N{\fnArial\fs30}The only apps on my phone are the ones that came with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.04,0:23:49.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 以及橄榄园 - 因为你在那\N{\fnArial\fs30}- And the Olive Garden. - Ah, because when you're there…
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.38,0:23:51.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的家人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're family.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.72,0:23:54.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.93,0:24:00.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,浣熊又来了 他们会看到惊喜\N{\fnArial\fs30}The racoons are back. And they are in for a surprise.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.30,0:24:02.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的惊喜最好不是镇定剂枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your surprise better not be my tranquilizer gun.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.64,0:24:03.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们只是饿了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're just hungry.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.94,0:24:06.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,再说 那是对付熊的\N{\fnArial\fs30}And also, that's for bears.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.30,0:24:09.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 很好 我知道它会管用的 - 汤姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Good, now I know it'll work. - Tom!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.52,0:24:11.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,开玩笑的 我只是用这个吓它们\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm kidding, I'm just gonna use it to scare them.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.01,0:24:14.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 可能会致死 爱你亲爱的 再见 - 汤\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Possibly to death. Love you, honey, bye. - To…
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.10,0:24:21.83,Note,0,0,0,0,,（离婚）
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.94,0:24:24.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 我进来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, I'm in.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.56,0:24:27.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,对甜甜圈殿下的财产造成最小的损失\N{\fnArial\fs30}With minimal damage to Donut Lord's property.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.92,0:24:29.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以开始了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.97,0:24:31.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,在地球上没有成功 没关系\N{\fnArial\fs30}Didn't work out on Earth, but that's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.49,0:24:33.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会去一个安全的世界\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're going to a safe world.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.43,0:24:35.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个全是蘑菇的安全的世界\N{\fnArial\fs30}A nice safe world full of mushrooms.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.28,0:24:38.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,蘑菇将是你唯一的朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mushrooms that will be your only friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.96,0:24:40.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,听上去坏极了 我做不到\N{\fnArial\fs30}That sounds awful, I can't do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.06,0:24:43.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,你一定要这么做 没有其他选择了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have to do it, there's no other option.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.29,0:24:46.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.74,0:24:51.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,等待背景调查的旧金山警员 举起爪子\N{\fnArial\fs30}SFPD, pending background check. Paws in the air!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.54,0:25:07.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,旧金山\N{\fnArial\fs30}San Francisco?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.67,0:25:31.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.67,0:25:36.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么情况\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.65,0:26:01.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,蓝恶魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Blue Devil.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.26,0:26:16.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 甜甜圈殿下 - 你可以说话\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Donut Lord? - You can talk?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.18,0:26:18.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not…
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.52,0:26:21.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你不是来绑架我的吧 - 你绑架了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You're not here to abduct me, are you? - You abducted me!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.80,0:26:25.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 有道理 你是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, it's a fair point. What are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.30,0:26:26.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么藏在我的车库里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why are you hiding out in my garage?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.13,0:26:28.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我需要一个安全的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}I needed somewhere safe,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:28.47,0:26:31.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是我唯一能够想到的人 甜甜圈殿下\N{\fnArial\fs30}and you are the only person I could think of, Donut Lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.14,0:26:32.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为什么叫我甜甜圈殿下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why do you keep calling me Donut Lord?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.02,0:26:33.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为你和甜甜圈说话\N{\fnArial\fs30}'Cause you talk to donuts,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.06,0:26:35.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,假如它们不守规矩就把它们吃掉\N{\fnArial\fs30}and then eat them if they get out of the line.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.06,0:26:38.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好吧 有理 - 等等 蘑菇都去哪里了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Again, fair. - Wait… Where are all the mushrooms?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.50,0:26:41.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我为什么还在地球上 我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why am I still on Earth? What did…
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.16,0:26:43.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,糟糕 我戒指丢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, no, I lost my rings!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.13,0:26:44.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.00,0:26:52.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,发生了什么 是你们的母舰吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's happening? Is this your mothership?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.46,0:26:56.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我没心情被探测 - 你担心了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm not in the mood to get probed. - You think you're worried?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:56.15,0:26:57.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我连裤子都没穿\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not even wearing pants.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.32,0:27:02.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the…
Dialogue: 0,0:27:04.07,0:27:06.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他们来抓我了 - 谁来抓你\N{\fnArial\fs30}- They're coming for me! - Who's coming for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:06.41,0:27:07.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,这跟我有什么关系\N{\fnArial\fs30}What does that have to do with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:07.87,0:27:08.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没时间解释\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't have time to explain,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.35,0:27:11.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 但你必须要帮助我 - 我不 为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- but you have to help me. - No, I don't. Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:12.03,0:27:12.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的腿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, my legs,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:12.77,0:27:15.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,通常被归类为致命凶器\N{\fnArial\fs30}which normally would be classified as lethal weapons.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.50,0:27:16.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在感觉像面条一样软\N{\fnArial\fs30}feel like spaghetti.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:16.77,0:27:19.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我需要你的帮忙 求求你 生死攸关\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need your help, please. It's life or death.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:27.31,0:27:29.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 跟我走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fine, come with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.54,0:27:34.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,帮一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Little help?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.02,0:27:48.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 待在这 别出声 - 好计划 极好的计划\N{\fnArial\fs30}- All right, stay here. And be quiet. - Good plan, great plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.33,0:27:50.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们怎么合作的这么好\N{\fnArial\fs30}How are we working so well together?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.09,0:27:52.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,简直心有灵犀\N{\fnArial\fs30}Practically finishing each other sentences.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.49,0:27:54.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 再见\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.10,0:27:59.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello there.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.30,0:28:01.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能帮你吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can I help you?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.27,0:28:07.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,早上好 乡下的朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good morning, my rural chum.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.84,0:28:08.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm…
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.26,0:28:11.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,来自电力公司 调查断电的事情\N{\fnArial\fs30}from the power company, investigating the blackout.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.88,0:28:12.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不介意的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you don't mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.42,0:28:15.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想看看你房子里面的读数\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd like to take a few readings inside your house?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.25,0:28:17.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,说实话 你真的是电力公司的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}No kidding, you're from the power company?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.32,0:28:18.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,你肯定知道我的朋友斯盆塞\N{\fnArial\fs30}You must know my buddy Spencer.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:18.46,0:28:20.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们一起玩垒球\N{\fnArial\fs30}We play softball together.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.40,0:28:23.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯盆塞 他人很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Spence, he's a good man.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:24.32,0:28:26.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是的 是的 请进 - 很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah, yeah… come on in! - Great.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.01,0:28:29.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,去看你想要的读数吧 除了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take all the readings you need. Except…
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.28,0:28:32.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,难道电力公司一般不都在房子外\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't the power company usually take their readings.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.06,0:28:33.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,收集读数吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}from outside the house?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.67,0:28:35.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,那样即使你不在家也可以检查\N{\fnArial\fs30}That way they can check even if you're not home.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.20,0:28:38.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,并且 我的朋友斯盆塞在煤气公司工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}Also, my buddy Spencer works for the gas company.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.82,0:28:40.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是一个极限飞盘选手\N{\fnArial\fs30}And he's more of an ultimate Frisbee guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:40.52,0:28:41.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以你是否想告诉我为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, you wanna tell me why.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:42.06,0:28:45.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得我会傻到让你直接进到我的房子里\N{\fnArial\fs30}you think I'm dumb enough to just let you walk inside my house?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:53.31,0:28:55.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 对不起 您是 - 瓦查斯基\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm sorry, Mr… - Wachowski.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:55.98,0:28:57.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,但大家都叫我汤姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}But everyone calls me Tom.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.74,0:28:59.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,除了我的牙医 他叫我蒂姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Except my dentist, he calls me Tim.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.89,0:29:01.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,但他已经叫了这么久了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But it's gone on for so long now.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:01.30,0:29:03.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我再纠正他就很会奇怪\N{\fnArial\fs30}that it would be just weird if I corrected him.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:03.51,0:29:05.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 被牙医叫做蒂姆的汤姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, Tom, whose dentist calls him Tim.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:05.76,0:29:07.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你应该注意到了整座城镇\N{\fnArial\fs30}You may have noticed that this entire town.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:07.90,0:29:09.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,都断电了\N{\fnArial\fs30}has been experiencing a power outage.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:09.93,0:29:11.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 没有电 注意到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yup, no lights, picked up on that.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.81,0:29:13.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,20分钟前我检测到了一个能量脉冲\N{\fnArial\fs30}Twenty minutes ago I tracked an energy pulse.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:13.96,0:29:14.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,与造成破坏的那个\N{\fnArial\fs30}with the similar signature.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:14.81,0:29:17.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,具有相似的特性\N{\fnArial\fs30}to the one that caused that disruption.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:31.79,0:29:33.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 你是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen, Mr…
Dialogue: 0,0:29:33.70,0:29:36.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,博士 罗伯特尼克博士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Doctor. Doctor Robotnik.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:36.44,0:29:38.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我的牙医叫我罗伯\N{\fnArial\fs30}But my dentist calls me Rob.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:39.59,0:29:42.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 罗博茨基博士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, Doctor Robotskiz…
Dialogue: 0,0:29:43.20,0:29:45.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你是为了很重要的事情来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sure what you're here for is very serious,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:45.38,0:29:48.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,但这对我不管用 你可以问镇上的任何人\N{\fnArial\fs30}but it's got nothing to do with me, you can ask anyone in town.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:48.30,0:29:49.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 每个人都认识我 - 我相信\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Everyone knows me. - I bet they do.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:50.14,0:29:52.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我相信你在这个漂亮的加油站休息站\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sure you're hella popular with the Gibs and Merles.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:52.78,0:29:55.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,很受吉布斯 梅尔斯和比利 鲍勃们的欢迎\N{\fnArial\fs30}and Billy Bobs in this glorified gas station rest stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:56.20,0:29:57.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,这可以追溯到斗牛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which goes way back to the days of.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.60,0:30:00.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,和用陶罐演奏的时代\N{\fnArial\fs30}tipping cows and playing on a jug band.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:03.17,0:30:05.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许某一天你会实现你的目标\N{\fnArial\fs30}And maybe some day you'll have achieved your goal.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:06.11,0:30:08.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,得到好市多的会员卡 或领养一只贵宾狗\N{\fnArial\fs30}of getting a Costco card, or adopting a Labradoodle.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:09.03,0:30:10.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,但现实是\N{\fnArial\fs30}But the reality is,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:10.55,0:30:14.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,在我学步之前就已经超越了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I surpassed everything you're ever going to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:16.18,0:30:18.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,你所能做的一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}before I was a toddler.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:18.23,0:30:19.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,在我能造出婴儿食品的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was spitting out formulas.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:19.38,0:30:21.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还在吃婴儿食品\N{\fnArial\fs30}while you were still spitting up formula.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:21.92,0:30:24.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我是母乳喂养的 - 很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I was breastfed, actually. - Nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:24.73,0:30:26.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,你敢对我孤儿的脸这么说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rub that in my orphan face.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:27.17,0:30:28.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,瓦查斯基先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Wachowski,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:28.61,0:30:32.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,你熟悉美国法典904标题10文章104吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}are you familiar with US code 904, title 10, article 104?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:34.34,0:30:36.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 熟悉 - 任何想要帮助\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah… - Anyone, who attempts to aid.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:36.29,0:30:39.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,美国的敌人的人都会被处死\N{\fnArial\fs30}an enemy of the United States shall suffer death.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:41.00,0:30:43.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果抓到你的人是我\N{\fnArial\fs30}And if I'm the one who catches you,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:43.47,0:30:45.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你会更惨\N{\fnArial\fs30}it'll be even worse.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:46.73,0:30:48.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,比死还惨\N{\fnArial\fs30}Worse than death?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:50.38,0:30:52.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 我是一个球 只是个普通的球\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, I'm a ball. Just a normal ball.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:52.25,0:30:53.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我样子圆鼓鼓的混在里面\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm blending in like a bulge.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:53.41,0:30:54.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,别说话了 不 你才别说话了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop talking. No, you stop talking.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:54.83,0:30:55.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,安静一点 索尼克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Be quiet, Sonic.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:55.50,0:30:56.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,你才要安静点呢 索尼克\N{\fnArial\fs30}You be quiet, Sonic!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:57.21,0:30:59.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我真希望他们没用X光扫描我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, I hope they aren't scanning me with X-Rays,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:59.79,0:31:02.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的午餐吃得真不怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had kind of an embarrassing lunch.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:09.56,0:31:11.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要害怕 不要害怕 不要害怕\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't freak out. Don't freak… Don't freak out.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:12.01,0:31:14.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要害怕 不要害怕\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't freak out. Don't freak out.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:15.44,0:31:16.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我真的好怕啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm freaking out!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:19.23,0:31:21.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为什么不在楼梯上铺一层地毯啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why don't you have your staircase carpeted?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:21.79,0:31:23.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,相比于\N{\fnArial\fs30}Compared to…
Dialogue: 0,0:31:25.91,0:31:27.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 管道老旧了 - 对啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Old pipes. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:27.64,0:31:29.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,可能只是房屋塌下来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Probably just the house settling.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:29.23,0:31:30.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,这儿没什么好看的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing to see here.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:31.88,0:31:33.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:38.27,0:31:39.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,听好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here's the thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:41.49,0:31:43.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我从来没算错过\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm never wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:43.79,0:31:46.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,凡事都有第一次的 对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, first time for everything, I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:46.26,0:31:47.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,想吃一点蛋糕吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Would you like some cake?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:47.46,0:31:49.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我听说浣熊嘴巴是最干净的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hear racoons have the cleanest mouths.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:49.30,0:31:50.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,相比于其他经常吃垃圾的动物\N{\fnArial\fs30}of any animal that routinely eats garbage.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:03.05,0:32:04.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at that.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:05.32,0:32:06.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是对的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was right.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:07.39,0:32:09.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,看这毫不惊讶的表情\N{\fnArial\fs30}Note the lack of surprise.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:09.51,0:32:11.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要再来一次吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Should we try this again?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:21.96,0:32:24.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我给你五秒钟的时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm going to give you five seconds.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:24.67,0:32:25.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉我它在哪儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}to tell me where it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:26.00,0:32:26.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,五\N{\fnArial\fs30}Five.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:26.50,0:32:27.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道你在说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know what's you're talking about.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:27.59,0:32:28.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,四\N{\fnArial\fs30}Four.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:28.12,0:32:29.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,恶棍 我可是名警察\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, tough guy, I'm a cop.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:29.42,0:32:30.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,你正在威胁一名警官\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you're threatening an Officer.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:30.55,0:32:31.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我又怎能威胁一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}How can you threaten somebody.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:31.34,0:32:31.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,从来没存在过的人呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}who never existed?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:32.13,0:32:33.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,三\N{\fnArial\fs30}Three.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:34.22,0:32:36.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点 动动你的脑子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, rack your brain!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:36.18,0:32:37.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许还有机会想些\N{\fnArial\fs30}You might be able to come up with.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:37.35,0:32:39.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,站不住脚的理由救你自己一命\N{\fnArial\fs30}some lame excuse to go on living.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:39.89,0:32:40.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,二\N{\fnArial\fs30}In two…
Dialogue: 0,0:32:42.02,0:32:42.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,一\N{\fnArial\fs30}One!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:43.60,0:32:45.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 别伤害他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait! Don't hurt him.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:49.23,0:32:50.23,Note,0,0,0,0,,（威胁 认证）
Dialogue: 0,0:32:59.13,0:33:00.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,它的火力太猛了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}This feels excessive.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:02.16,0:33:03.54,Note,0,0,0,0,,（武器 重装）
Dialogue: 0,0:33:04.25,0:33:05.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,待在我后面\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay behind me.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:18.01,0:33:19.10,Note,0,0,0,0,,（瞄准）
Dialogue: 0,0:33:21.58,0:33:24.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,别担心 一切在我的掌控之中\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't worry, I got it right where I want it.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:26.60,0:33:27.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,你敢相信亚马逊要用\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you believe Amazon is gonna.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:27.86,0:33:29.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些东西来运送包裹\N{\fnArial\fs30}deliver packages with these things?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:32.53,0:33:35.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个计划糟透了 我当时在想什么啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}This was a horrible plan, what was I thinking?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:37.93,0:33:39.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要吐出来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna puke!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:43.24,0:33:44.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,快来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:45.26,0:33:46.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得离开这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}We gotta get out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:46.68,0:33:48.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,别跟我说你就这么点能耐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't tell me that's all you've got.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:48.50,0:33:49.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我才刚刚开始呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm just getting started.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:49.87,0:33:52.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想和我蓝小子再打上第二回合吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me know if you wanna go round two with the blue.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:11.43,0:34:12.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,博士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Doctor!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:12.96,0:34:14.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:14.34,0:34:16.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我刚看到一个人跑走了 然后我就想\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just saw a guy race outta here and thought…
Dialogue: 0,0:34:16.50,0:34:17.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,想你应该把它们拦下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}That you should stop them?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:19.06,0:34:20.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,张开嘴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Open your mouth,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:20.80,0:34:22.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后说 你想你该去拦住他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}and say you thought that you should stop them.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:22.99,0:34:26.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有 我想我或许该确定您的安危\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I thought that maybe I should check to see if you're okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:26.44,0:34:27.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道什么事会困扰\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what's hard about.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:27.82,0:34:29.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,世界上最聪明的人吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}being the smartest person in the world?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:29.30,0:34:31.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,别的人看起来都很笨\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everyone else seems stupid.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:31.12,0:34:32.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 说得好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes. Way to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:32.43,0:34:33.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,你答对了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got that one.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:35.13,0:34:36.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管那个生物是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whatever this creature is,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:36.96,0:34:38.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的任务就是得到它\N{\fnArial\fs30}it's our job to secure it,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:39.34,0:34:42.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,消除它的力量 发现其力量之源\N{\fnArial\fs30}neutralize it, uncover the source of its power.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:43.12,0:34:44.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是它敢反抗\N{\fnArial\fs30}And if it resists…
Dialogue: 0,0:34:45.62,0:34:47.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,就把它剖解开\N{\fnArial\fs30}we take it apart,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:47.78,0:34:49.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,一点 一点\N{\fnArial\fs30}piece by piece.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:50.39,0:34:52.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看它这么做为了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}See what makes it tick.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:53.28,0:34:54.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 斯通 - 博士\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Stone. - Doctor.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:54.84,0:34:56.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,打个电话给研究视错觉的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Call Optical Illusions.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:57.16,0:34:58.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉他们我要副新的眼镜框\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell them I need new frames.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:59.52,0:35:01.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们知道我喜欢什么样的\N{\fnArial\fs30}They know what kind I like.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:02.98,0:35:04.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,把那根刺也带上\N{\fnArial\fs30}And bring that quill.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:05.16,0:35:06.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,是 博士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, Doctor.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:08.04,0:35:09.79,Note,0,0,0,0,,（欢迎来到青山镇 小镇子 大胸怀）
Dialogue: 0,0:35:09.79,0:35:11.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 伙计\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, pal,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:11.12,0:35:12.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,你现在得和我好好谈一谈了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You need to start talking right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:12.92,0:35:15.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是谁 你是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who are you? What are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:15.45,0:35:17.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是一只刺猬 我觉得这显而易见\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm a hedgehog, I feel like that's obvious.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:17.98,0:35:20.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我现在麻烦大了 - 你麻烦大了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- And I'm in big trouble. - You're in big trouble?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:20.70,0:35:22.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,你又没有一拳打下那个\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not the one who punched.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:22.17,0:35:23.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,好像是政府派来的怪人\N{\fnArial\fs30}some sort of government weirdo back there.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:23.80,0:35:26.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得你有麻烦 我的戒指丢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think you have problems? I lost my rings!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:26.17,0:35:27.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,戒指 你在说什么啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rings? What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:27.84,0:35:30.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 高级生物就是用戒指\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, rings are how all advanced cultures.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:30.15,0:35:31.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,在星球之间穿梭的\N{\fnArial\fs30}travel between worlds.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:31.68,0:35:34.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在我的戒指却在一幢尖尖的建筑顶端\N{\fnArial\fs30}And now mine are on top of a pointy building.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:34.17,0:35:36.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只在你的紧身衬衫上见过那建筑\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've only ever seen on your skin tight t-shirt.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:37.30,0:35:39.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以 我希望你带我去旧金山\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, I'd like you to take me to San Francisco,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:39.67,0:35:40.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我拿回戒指\N{\fnArial\fs30}so I can get back my rings.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:40.95,0:35:42.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后用它穿梭去蘑菇星球\N{\fnArial\fs30}and use them to go to the Mushroom planet.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:44.65,0:35:46.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 蘑菇星球 - 对\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Mushroom planet? - Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:47.40,0:35:48.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:52.38,0:35:53.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 伙计 出去吧你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, pal. Out you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:53.92,0:35:54.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起 什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry, what?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:55.04,0:35:57.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 这个时候我是不可能\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, this is the worst possible time for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:57.34,0:35:58.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,给自己惹麻烦的 好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}to get myself into trouble, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:59.10,0:36:01.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,你让我救你一命 我救了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}You asked me to save your life, I saved your life.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:01.34,0:36:03.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在请你 去找你的戒指\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now please, go find your rings,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:03.30,0:36:04.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有你的蘑菇星球\N{\fnArial\fs30}and your Mushroomland.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:04.43,0:36:06.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我真希望能在医院的床上醒来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hopefully I'm gonna wake up in the hospital bed,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:06.71,0:36:07.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后医生来和我说\N{\fnArial\fs30}and the doctors gonna tell me.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:07.87,0:36:09.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的结肠镜检查很成功\N{\fnArial\fs30}that my colonoscopy was a big success.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:09.21,0:36:09.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吗 那么 再见吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay? So, goodbye.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:10.48,0:36:11.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 再见了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, goodbye.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:12.37,0:36:13.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,再见\N{\fnArial\fs30}Goodbye.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:16.02,0:36:17.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为什么还不走啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why aren't you leaving?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:17.12,0:36:18.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道旧金山在哪里\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know where San Francisco is.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:18.92,0:36:19.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 在西边 - 西边\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's West. - West?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:20.03,0:36:21.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,往前走 错不了的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Straight shot, can't miss it.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:21.39,0:36:22.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 好极了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fine. That's cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:22.43,0:36:24.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在我就能大大方方说再见了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm totally cool saying goodbye now.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:29.39,0:36:33.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,当我一头扎进太平洋阴冷的海水里时\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, as I crashed into the cold dark water of the Pacific.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:33.57,0:36:35.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我明白了些事情\N{\fnArial\fs30}I realized a few things.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:35.91,0:36:38.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,第一 我对要走的路一无所知\N{\fnArial\fs30}A I have no idea where I'm going;
Dialogue: 0,0:36:38.45,0:36:40.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,第二 海水可真刺骨\N{\fnArial\fs30}b salt water stings.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:40.90,0:36:43.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,第三 我本来早就不在这星球了\N{\fnArial\fs30}C I shouldn't even be on this planet right now,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:43.76,0:36:45.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我还在\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:45.20,0:36:47.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 为什么 因为你射了我 - 我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Why? Because you shot me! - I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:48.21,0:36:49.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,你射了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You shot me!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:49.43,0:36:52.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 说一次我就听到了 你没必要\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. I heard you the first time. You don't have to…
Dialogue: 0,0:36:52.23,0:36:53.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,再说一遍 天哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}pile it on, good grief.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:53.92,0:36:56.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我湿透了 我冷极了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm wet. I'm cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:56.41,0:36:58.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我头上还挂着一条鱼\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's a fish on my head!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:58.42,0:37:01.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,很明显我单单一个人是到不了那里的\N{\fnArial\fs30}And clearly I'm not gonna be able to do this on my own.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:07.79,0:37:09.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 到车上来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, get in the truck.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:09.17,0:37:10.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的 你要帮我了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really? You gonna help me?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:10.56,0:37:12.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许我是有那么一点点错的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I guess it is a little bit of my fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:12.20,0:37:13.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些事情发生到你头上\N{\fnArial\fs30}that all of this is happening to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:13.88,0:37:15.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是一点点 是全部\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not a little bit, entirely.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:15.40,0:37:16.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,这全部是你的错\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is entirely your fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:16.91,0:37:18.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 这全部是我的错 你要上来吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, it's entirely my fault. Are you coming?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:18.94,0:37:20.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,要\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:22.54,0:37:24.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,公路旅行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Roadtrip.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:24.90,0:37:26.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是在干什么啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}What am I doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:26.77,0:37:28.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 这次出行是有约法三章的\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, there's gonna be rules on this trip.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:28.87,0:37:31.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,第一 自始至终你都得听我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Number one: do exactly as I say all the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:32.12,0:37:33.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 明白吗 - 明白 甜甜圈殿下\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Got it? - Got it, Donut Lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:34.10,0:37:35.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能不能别叫我甜甜圈殿下了啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Would you stop with the Donut Lord?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:36.31,0:37:38.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有名字 我叫汤姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have a name. It's Tom.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:38.48,0:37:39.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我叫索尼克\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm Sonic.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:40.00,0:37:42.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,索尼克 索尼克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sonic? Sonic.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:43.27,0:37:45.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以说 这些年你一直在窥视我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, you've been spying on us all for years.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:45.60,0:37:47.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得这不叫窥视\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, I wouldn't call it spying.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:47.46,0:37:48.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们都只是出来玩啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}We were all just hanging out,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:48.70,0:37:49.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有我是没人邀请的\N{\fnArial\fs30}only I wasn't invited,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:49.84,0:37:51.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有人知道我在那儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}and no one knew I was there.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:51.48,0:37:54.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不敢相信疯子卡尔一直都是对的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't believe Crazy Carl was right all this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:54.26,0:37:57.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,你应该叫他超级观察家卡尔了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, you should call him Super Observing Carl instead.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:57.73,0:37:59.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的天啊 马上停车\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh my God, stop the car right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:59.36,0:38:00.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么 什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? What?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:00.18,0:38:02.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,世界上最大的橡皮筋球\N{\fnArial\fs30}The World's Largest Rubber Band Ball?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:02.50,0:38:03.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们去看看吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}We gotta see it!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:03.63,0:38:04.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,不行 不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:04.28,0:38:07.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不是什么有趣的家庭旅行 好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is not some fun family roadtrip, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:07.34,0:38:10.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,政府想要解剖你 逮捕我\N{\fnArial\fs30}The government wants to dissect you, and arrest me.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:10.54,0:38:11.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,这事非常严肃\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is serious.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:12.97,0:38:14.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是对的 它可真差劲\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were right. It was lame.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:14.26,0:38:15.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是礼品店还不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gift shop was cool, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:15.62,0:38:16.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我给你带了个鼠标垫\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got you a mouse pad.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:17.12,0:38:18.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们什么时候才能到那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}When are we gonna get there?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:18.74,0:38:20.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,该到的时候自然就到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We will get there when we get there.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:39.67,0:38:41.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 我得先去确定一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, I'm gonna go check in with Wade.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:41.56,0:38:42.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,韦德知不知道发生了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}to see if he knows what's going on.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:43.12,0:38:45.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要到那层玻璃里见韦德\N{\fnArial\fs30}You gonna see Wade in that glass thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:45.46,0:38:47.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是什么 一个传送箱\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is it? A teleportation box?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:49.17,0:38:50.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是公共电话\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a pay phone.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:50.27,0:38:53.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,一般只有毒品贩子和逃犯用得上\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's mostly for drug dealers and fugitives from the law,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:53.10,0:38:53.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,而我们就是\N{\fnArial\fs30}which is us.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:53.90,0:38:56.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,待在车子里 我不想让别人看见你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay in the car. I don't want anybody seeing you.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:56.63,0:38:57.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fine!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:16.46,0:39:19.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 好了 那是世界上最酷的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. Okay. That is the coolest place on Earth,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:19.30,0:39:21.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是你必须得待在车里\N{\fnArial\fs30}but you have to stay in the car.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:30.41,0:39:32.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,坚持住 坚持住\N{\fnArial\fs30}Be strong. Be strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:39.93,0:39:42.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,您好 这里是青山镇警察局\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello. Green Hills Police Department.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:42.24,0:39:45.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 韦德 是我 - 你能打过来真好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Wade, it's me. - Hi, I'm so glad that you called.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:45.40,0:39:48.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,之前有几个人过来问了些问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, some guys came in asking some questions.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:48.54,0:39:49.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,有点怪怪的\N{\fnArial\fs30}A little creepy.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:50.04,0:39:52.37,Title,0,0,0,0,,样子像是从《黑衣人》里出来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kinda reminded me of the guys from Men in Black,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:52.49,0:39:55.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,但也没有那么像 没有威尔·史密斯有魅力\N{\fnArial\fs30}but not as likable, or charming as Will Smith.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:56.10,0:39:57.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 什么样的问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait, what kinda questions?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:57.86,0:40:00.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,有关恐怖主义\N{\fnArial\fs30}Questions about terrorism.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:00.62,0:40:02.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我跟他们说\N{\fnArial\fs30}I told them that, like…
Dialogue: 0,0:40:02.13,0:40:03.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我和汤姆一起去冰上钓过鱼\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've gone ice fishing with Tom.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:03.94,0:40:05.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,他不知道怎么做炸弹\N{\fnArial\fs30}He doesn't know how to make a bomb.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:05.78,0:40:07.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,在大冷天里 甚至连鱼饵也做不了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He can't even make, like bait in the cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:07.83,0:40:10.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 韦德 听我说 这非常关键\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, Wade, listen to me. This is really important.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:10.11,0:40:12.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我给你打电话这事 别告诉他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't tell them that we talked, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:15.13,0:40:17.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得他们已经知道了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, I think they already know.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:19.19,0:40:20.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,瓦查斯基先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Wachowski.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:21.73,0:40:22.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我叫汤姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tom.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:22.90,0:40:24.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我告诉你 除你之外另一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want you to know that the only other person.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:24.86,0:40:25.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,往我脸上打了一拳的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}who have ever punched me in the face.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:25.86,0:40:27.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,是个校园恶霸\N{\fnArial\fs30}was the school bully.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:28.07,0:40:29.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在自助餐厅里打了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}He hit me in the cafeteria.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:29.49,0:40:31.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我眼眶骨周围的软组织\N{\fnArial\fs30}causing a blunt force contusion to the soft tissue.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:31.86,0:40:33.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,被钝器挫伤\N{\fnArial\fs30}surrounding my orbital bone.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:33.74,0:40:35.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在全校面前羞辱了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Humiliated me in front of the entire school.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:35.78,0:40:37.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道我怎么报复他的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you know what I did in response?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:38.07,0:40:40.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,你应该把他举报到了校长办公室\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm assuming that you reported him to the Principal's office,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:40.79,0:40:42.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为这种行为真的让人无法接受\N{\fnArial\fs30}'cause, you know that kinda behavior is really unacceptable.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:42.98,0:40:44.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有 我检测了世界会有多么低效\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I examined the inefficiency of a world.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:44.98,0:40:46.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果满是四肢发达 头脑简单的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}where brawn trumped brain,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:46.30,0:40:49.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,于是我用科技克服了这种低效\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I used technology to resolve that inefficiency.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:49.09,0:40:51.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个男孩用吸管吸食自己的肉\N{\fnArial\fs30}The boy ate his meals through a straw.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:51.20,0:40:52.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,吸了整整一年\N{\fnArial\fs30}for a year.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:52.32,0:40:54.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,从此我再也没打输过了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I have never lost a fight again.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:54.63,0:40:55.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,直到今天\N{\fnArial\fs30}Until today.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:56.12,0:40:57.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,为我欢呼吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hooray for me then, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:57.55,0:41:00.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 因为你即将成为那个吸管男孩\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, because you're about to become the bully with a straw!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:00.35,0:41:02.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来找你了 瓦查斯基先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm coming for you, Mr. Wachowski.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:02.93,0:41:04.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,当我抓到你的时候 我要\N{\fnArial\fs30}And when I catch you I'll…
Dialogue: 0,0:41:05.84,0:41:07.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂 喂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello? Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:08.96,0:41:11.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 喂 喂 - 我觉得他把电话挂了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hello? Hello? - I think he actually hung up.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:11.63,0:41:13.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我发现这里的灯暗了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because I noticed that the light isn't on.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:13.21,0:41:14.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你 脑残警官\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you, Officer Brainfart.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:14.69,0:41:17.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,再给我一秒钟 我可以接通外线\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you give me a second I can get an outside line.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:17.24,0:41:19.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 别费事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, don't be bothered.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:19.45,0:41:20.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你只需要坐在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}You just sit there.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:20.70,0:41:24.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,继续一无用处\N{\fnArial\fs30}and be you- sless.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:31.17,0:41:33.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有人要来消除我的记忆吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}No one's gonna erase my memory here?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:35.03,0:41:36.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要把这事告诉别人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will tell people about this.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:40.10,0:41:43.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,来了 算不上最健康的晚餐 但是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, not exactly the healthiest meal, but…
Dialogue: 0,0:41:44.40,0:41:45.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,索尼克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sonic?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:51.81,0:41:53.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:08.46,0:42:09.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好啊 搭档\N{\fnArial\fs30}Howdy, partner.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:09.91,0:42:11.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是你搭档 快来 我们要走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not your partner, come on, we're leaving.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:11.82,0:42:13.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是这里有个ZZ Top摇滚乐队\N{\fnArial\fs30}But there's a ZZ Top cover band,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:13.57,0:42:14.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,你来看看他们的胡子\N{\fnArial\fs30}you gotta see their beards.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:14.55,0:42:15.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在不是看这个的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}We will have to catch them some other time.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:15.84,0:42:16.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们走 起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go. Get up.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:16.93,0:42:18.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我保证 如果这次让我留下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}If we stay I promise I won't say another word.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:18.76,0:42:19.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,之后再也不会提要求了\N{\fnArial\fs30}for the rest of the trip.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:20.10,0:42:21.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在 开始\N{\fnArial\fs30}Starting… now.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:22.69,0:42:23.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,欢迎来到活塞洞穴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Welcome to the Piston Pit,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:23.95,0:42:25.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们想要点什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}what can I get you fellas?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:25.31,0:42:26.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想要玉米片 辣鸡翅\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want nachos and buffalo wings,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:26.35,0:42:27.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有鳄梨酱\N{\fnArial\fs30}and guac.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:27.23,0:42:29.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个词真搞笑 对吧 鳄梨酱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Funny word, isn't it? Guac.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:29.41,0:42:29.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,鳄梨酱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guac.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:30.44,0:42:31.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,小孩子是不准进来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}No kids allowed in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:31.74,0:42:33.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,他脸上带着什么 一幅面具\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's he got on, some kinda mask?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:34.15,0:42:36.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,其实他43岁了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's actually 43 years old,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:36.06,0:42:38.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,得了一种非常罕见的皮肤病\N{\fnArial\fs30}and suffers from a very rare skin disease.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:38.88,0:42:41.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,这病遏制了他的发育 让他看起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}That stunts his growth, and makes him look…
Dialogue: 0,0:42:41.58,0:42:42.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,就 就像那样\N{\fnArial\fs30}like… like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:43.12,0:42:44.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,脸是爸妈给的\N{\fnArial\fs30}The face I was born with,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:44.72,0:42:47.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,但无敌般的自信可是我自己一手培养的\N{\fnArial\fs30}the confidence I picked up along the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:47.64,0:42:50.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 麻烦给我们做一杯「浓郁日落」 - 好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Make us a Mellow Yellow please. - Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:51.11,0:42:53.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你欠我的 - 我从来没坐过酒吧的凳子\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You owe me one. - I've never sat on a bar stool before.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:54.00,0:42:57.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,黏糊糊的 快看啊 还能旋转\N{\fnArial\fs30}So squishy. Oh, look at this, it spins!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:57.98,0:42:59.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:59.90,0:43:01.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我晕了 - 好玩吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I feel sick. - Having fun?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:02.19,0:43:04.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要把这一项从愿望清单上划掉吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gonna check this off the ol' bucket list, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:04.37,0:43:04.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,不错嘛老兄\N{\fnArial\fs30}Big night for ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:05.08,0:43:06.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,愿望清单是啥啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's a bucket list?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:07.12,0:43:08.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,愿望清单就是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bucket list is a…
Dialogue: 0,0:43:09.19,0:43:12.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,在你翘辫子之前 由你打算完成的事情\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a list of things you wanna do in your life before you…
Dialogue: 0,0:43:13.05,0:43:14.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,组成的清单\N{\fnArial\fs30}well, kick the bucket.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:14.32,0:43:17.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还从来没翘过辫子呢 我得做一份清单\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've never kicked the bucket either. I gotta make my list.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:23.02,0:43:24.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,索尼克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sonic.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:31.45,0:43:32.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么啦 有事吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why? What's the matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:32.72,0:43:34.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还有太多事情没有做过呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is so much stuff I've never done.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:34.73,0:43:37.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,可我马上就要永远离开地球了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And now that I'm leaving Earth forever…
Dialogue: 0,0:43:37.55,0:43:39.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想我已经错过了体验人生的机会了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I guess I missed my chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:44.52,0:43:46.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么说呢 我猜这里大概也算一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I guess this is the kinda place.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:46.39,0:43:47.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可以在短时间内\N{\fnArial\fs30}you can get a lot of living done.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:48.03,0:43:49.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,做很多有意义的事情的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}in a short period of time.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:50.33,0:43:52.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想我们可以在这儿逗留上几个小时\N{\fnArial\fs30}I suppose we can spare an hour.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:13.09,0:44:14.43,Note,0,0,0,0,,（参加一场比赛）
Dialogue: 0,0:44:24.97,0:44:26.44,Note,0,0,0,0,,（玩一次灌篮）
Dialogue: 0,0:44:51.30,0:44:52.21,Note,0,0,0,0,,（驯服一头野兽）
Dialogue: 0,0:43:52.21,0:43:54.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么 你愿意和我一起做愿望清单的事吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? You gonna bucket list with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:54.87,0:43:57.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 当然啦 为什么不呢 - 你不会后悔的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Sure, why not. - You won't regret this.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:57.45,0:43:58.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想我肯定会的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm pretty sure I will.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:23.44,0:44:24.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,新纪录\N{\fnArial\fs30}New high score.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:31.21,0:44:32.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,等一下 这头牛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait a second, is this bull.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:32.80,0:44:34.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,到底是没有头 还是有两个屁股\N{\fnArial\fs30}missing a head or does it have two butts?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:37.37,0:44:39.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 放轻松 - 好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- This is easy. - Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:44.22,0:44:45.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是个牛仔啊 宝贝儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm a cowboy, baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:48.94,0:44:50.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没事儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:56.90,0:44:58.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是这感觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:00.38,0:45:01.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,笑啊 笑得真开心啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, laugh it up.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:02.19,0:45:03.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,干得好 你这天生情种\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nice work, Romeo.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:04.27,0:45:06.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,看到你在这玩的开心我也很高兴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Glad you're having a good time.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:06.03,0:45:06.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我玩的太开心了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am having a good time.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:07.06,0:45:08.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我正享受着人生最好的时光\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm having the best time,
Dialogue: 0,0:45:08.50,0:45:09.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么可能有问题呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean what could go wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:13.81,0:45:15.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们有事吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can we help you?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:15.40,0:45:17.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不想让你们这类人出现在这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't like your kind around here.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:17.94,0:45:19.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们这类人 哪类人啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our kind? What kind is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:21.48,0:45:22.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,嬉皮士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hipsters.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:23.24,0:45:24.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么敢叫我们嬉皮士\N{\fnArial\fs30}How dare you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:24.40,0:45:26.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道吗 我们反正也准备走了 对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, you know what? We were just leaving anyway, weren't we?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:27.01,0:45:28.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这没什么的 - 不不不 我们不走\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Not a problem… - No, no. It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:28.83,0:45:29.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不 我们要走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no. We're leaving.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:29.91,0:45:32.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很是知道怎么处理这种情况\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know exactly how to handle this situation.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:33.50,0:45:34.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,快速问答小测验\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pop quiz hot-shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:34.85,0:45:37.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你刚刚挑衅了一只经常看动作片的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You just picked a fight with a poorly disguised hedgehog.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:37.64,0:45:40.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,乔装打扮的刺猬 你该怎么办\N{\fnArial\fs30}who's seen way too many action movies. What do you do?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:40.60,0:45:42.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,你该怎么办\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you do?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:44.93,0:45:47.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是疯了吗 这个按理说应该会被打碎的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Am I crazy? It was supposed to break, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:48.88,0:45:51.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,打碎啊 打碎啊 打碎啊 求你了 瓶子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Break please. Break please. Break please, bottle. Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:51.87,0:45:53.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,索尼克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sonic?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:04.84,0:46:07.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 干得好 - 谢谢 刚才那出精彩极了对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Nice going. - Thanks. It's awesome, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:07.62,0:46:09.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 还有谁 谁想挨揍啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, who's next? Who wants some?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:09.78,0:46:11.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,来个能打的啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who do I get to beat up?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:11.76,0:46:13.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,对了 有人见到我那位女服务生吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, has anybody seen my waitress?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:13.96,0:46:16.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的香辣鸡翅还没上来呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Still waiting on those buffalo wings.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:17.05,0:46:18.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,是你啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah, you!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:30.02,0:46:31.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,玩真的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:20.17,0:48:22.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 所以我们也该走了对吧 - 对 该走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- So, should we get out of here? - Yeah, time to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:25.10,0:48:26.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,那简直爽翻了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was amazing!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:26.32,0:48:29.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,等一下 我们付小费了吗 那不重要\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait a second, did we even pay our tip? It doesn't matter!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:29.40,0:48:32.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,瞧瞧这个 瞧瞧这个 我一直想做这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Watch this. Watch this. I always wanted to do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:35.28,0:48:37.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 抓住他们 - 再见了 人渣们\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Get them! - See ya, suckers.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:38.53,0:48:41.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是百分百确定 但我感觉他们喜欢我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't say for sure, but I think they liked me.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:47.15,0:48:48.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 爽翻了 - 爽\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yes! Yes! - Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:49.49,0:48:50.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们对你下手挺重\N{\fnArial\fs30}They got you pretty good.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:50.96,0:48:52.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没事 就是结结实实挨了一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm all right, have been hit harder.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:52.51,0:48:53.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看没看到为了做那个木乃伊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you see how much.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:53.43,0:48:54.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我用了多少卫生纸\N{\fnArial\fs30}toilet paper I used?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:54.33,0:48:56.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,下一个走进厕所的人都要\N{\fnArial\fs30}The next person that goes into that bathroom.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:56.48,0:48:57.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有擦屁股的东西啦\N{\fnArial\fs30}will have nothing to wipe with.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:58.36,0:49:00.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,那地板黏糊糊的 人群乱糟糟的\N{\fnArial\fs30}The floors were sticky. The crowd was rough.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:00.62,0:49:02.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,一切都对我们俩很不利\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the odds were against us.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:02.25,0:49:05.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,但没有什么能阻挡甜甜圈殿下和蓝色光影\N{\fnArial\fs30}But there was no stopping Donut Lord and the Blue Blur.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:05.88,0:49:08.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以从清单上再划掉一条了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Scratch another one off my list.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:08.33,0:49:09.26,Note,0,0,0,0,,（在酒吧打一架）
Dialogue: 0,0:49:09.54,0:49:11.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真是个奇怪的小家伙\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are a weird little dude.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:23.97,0:49:26.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 行了 - 所以说 我们现在怎么办\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Okay. - So, what are we gonna do now?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:27.95,0:49:30.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要看会儿电视杀杀时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna pass out watching TV.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:30.34,0:49:32.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你也看吧 - 但这是我在地球上最后一晚\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You should, too. - But this is my last night on Earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:32.96,0:49:35.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我想过好最后时光的每一刻 - 好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I wanna soak up every last second. - All right, well…
Dialogue: 0,0:49:35.43,0:49:38.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,做做任何你能在这个房间能做的事吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anything you can find to do in this room, you knock yourself out.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:45.21,0:49:47.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我玩得很开心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good times.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:49.60,0:49:51.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,天哪 不是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:51.33,0:49:53.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,臭死了 你吃啥了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's awful, what did you eat?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:53.37,0:49:55.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,那东西好像叫辣热狗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think it's called a chili dog.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:56.08,0:49:58.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,你最好检查一下你的毛有没有被崩掉\N{\fnArial\fs30}You might wanna check your fur on that one, buddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:59.32,0:50:02.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以说 你要去的下个星球长什么样子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, so what's this next planet you're supposed to go to like?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:02.56,0:50:05.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,和地球完全不一样 我给你说 空无一人\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's no Earth. I can tell you that. There's no people.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:05.55,0:50:08.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有能呼吸的空气和巨大的蘑菇什么的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just breathable air and giant mushrooms, and stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:09.00,0:50:10.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不如这么看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, look at it this way.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:11.10,0:50:13.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,至少你不会是唯一一个笑屁\N{\fnArial\fs30}At least you won't be the only fun-gi.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:14.00,0:50:16.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 别再放屁了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, don't ever do that again.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:17.69,0:50:19.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以前也爱这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}I liked it.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:20.91,0:50:22.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我真的会很想念这里的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm really gonna miss this place.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:23.16,0:50:25.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道我应该为了安全离开地球\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know I have to leave Earth to be safe,
Dialogue: 0,0:50:25.23,0:50:26.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,但如果长爪鸟是错的呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}but what if Longclaw was wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:28.01,0:50:30.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许我也能在这里生活\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe I could have a life here.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:34.68,0:50:37.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,好啦 我们该睡一会儿了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, we should get some sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:38.46,0:50:41.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,你睡吧 不用管我 我要用一整晚时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}You sleep, don't worry about me, I'm gonna stay up all night.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:41.76,0:50:43.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,趁来得及 好好享受地球\N{\fnArial\fs30}enjoying Earth while I can.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:43.74,0:50:45.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,没问题 小子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sure, kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:06.13,0:51:07.63,Note,0,0,0,0,,（交一个真正的朋友）
Dialogue: 0,0:50:45.71,0:50:47.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,记住我们要在八点钟上路\N{\fnArial\fs30}As long as we're on the road by eight.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:11.75,0:51:14.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,托马斯·瓦查斯基 被指控实施了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thomas Wachowski, accused of committing.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:14.19,0:51:15.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,国内恐怖主义活动\N{\fnArial\fs30}an act of domestic terrorism.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:16.42,0:51:19.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,瓦查斯基携带了武器 而且极度危险\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wachowski is considered armed and dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:19.33,0:51:22.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果您有关于他的信息 请立即向\N{\fnArial\fs30}Any information regarding his whereabouts should be reported.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:22.50,0:51:24.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,地方当局汇报\N{\fnArial\fs30}to local authorities immediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:30.55,0:51:32.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,他有没有提到他要去哪里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did he say where he was going?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:35.58,0:51:37.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许说了 也许没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe. Maybe not.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:38.99,0:51:40.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就这一句话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like I'd ever tell you.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:42.04,0:51:43.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,退后 斯通特工\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stand down, Agent Stone.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:43.67,0:51:46.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个好心的公民很明显没有明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}This well-meaning citizen obviously doesn't understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:46.29,0:51:48.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,整件事情的紧急性\N{\fnArial\fs30}the urgency of the matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:50.58,0:51:52.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:54.30,0:51:57.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是我说的那个叫「好坏警察」的游戏\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, that's what I call 'good cop, bad cop'.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:00.02,0:52:01.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,你露出破绽了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Left yourself open.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:04.16,0:52:06.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,根据去旧金山最近的路线\N{\fnArial\fs30}Judging by the quickest route to San Francisco,
Dialogue: 0,0:52:06.33,0:52:08.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们车子的平均速度\N{\fnArial\fs30}the approximate speed of their vehicle.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:08.16,0:52:09.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,以及当地天气情况来判断\N{\fnArial\fs30}and local weather conditions…
Dialogue: 0,0:52:10.97,0:52:12.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们应该\N{\fnArial\fs30}They should be…
Dialogue: 0,0:52:13.21,0:52:15.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,就在\N{\fnArial\fs30}right about…
Dialogue: 0,0:52:16.19,0:52:17.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}here.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:17.83,0:52:21.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你太聪明了 先生 - 谢谢 你个大头鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That's brilliant, Sir. - Thanks… for nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:22.21,0:52:23.99,Note,0,0,0,0,,（欢迎来到加州）
Dialogue: 0,0:52:23.99,0:52:26.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 话说 你的愿望清单上有什么 - 我吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- So, what's on your bucket list? - Me?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:26.60,0:52:28.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 人人都有愿望清单 对吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, everyone has a bucket list, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:28.73,0:52:29.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然啦 可是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, sure, but…
Dialogue: 0,0:52:29.55,0:52:31.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,你才是即将离开地球的那个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, you are the one leaving Earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:31.77,0:52:33.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,而我最近还没有赴死的打算\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I'm not planning on dying anytime soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:33.91,0:52:37.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,别这么确定 你最好的朋友可是个扫把星\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't be so sure, your best friend is a magnet for danger.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:37.21,0:52:39.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说你是我最好的朋友吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're anointing yourself as the bestie?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:40.32,0:52:42.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,有一点冒昧 但是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Little presumptuous, but… I mean…
Dialogue: 0,0:52:42.77,0:52:44.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我挺喜欢你的 这没的说 可是\N{\fnArial\fs30}I like you, of course, but…
Dialogue: 0,0:52:45.15,0:52:46.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要知道 我们不是最好的朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, we're not best friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:47.25,0:52:48.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,你昨天晚上抱我了啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}You tucked me in last night.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:49.18,0:52:51.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 那就是最好的动物朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fine, fine. Best animal friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:51.16,0:52:52.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,那应该是奥兹 我的狗狗\N{\fnArial\fs30}That would be my dog Ozzy.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:52.38,0:52:54.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,行吧 我们还是不谈这个越来越\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, let's drop this increasingly.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:54.38,0:52:56.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,让人丢脸的话题了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}humiliating topic of conversation.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:56.43,0:52:58.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的愿望清单 快告诉我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bucket list. Give it to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:58.64,0:53:00.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 有一件事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, there is one thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:01.49,0:53:03.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,在青山镇我一直觉得\N{\fnArial\fs30}In Green Hills I've always felt,
Dialogue: 0,0:53:03.80,0:53:06.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,自己不是警察 而是个保姆 你知道吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know, more like a baby sitter than a real cop, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:07.16,0:53:08.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我想找一个能在压力下\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, I want a chance to prove myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:08.95,0:53:09.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,证明我自己的机会\N{\fnArial\fs30}under real pressure.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:10.16,0:53:12.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要搬到旧金山去 当一个巡逻警\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna move to San Francisco, become a street cop.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:13.54,0:53:16.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道会怎么样 看之后会发生什么吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}And, I don't know, see if I have what it takes.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:17.35,0:53:18.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:19.83,0:53:21.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为什么一副那样的表情\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why is your face doing that?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:21.90,0:53:23.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要离开青山镇吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're leaving Green Hills?!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:24.09,0:53:26.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 原来是这样 - 可是 为什么啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Okay. - Bu… But… But why?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:26.13,0:53:27.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为什么要离开青山镇啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why would you leave Green Hills?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:27.64,0:53:29.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,这对你来说可能难以理解\N{\fnArial\fs30}This maybe hard for you to understand,
Dialogue: 0,0:53:29.33,0:53:31.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,但青山镇是个太小 太小的镇子\N{\fnArial\fs30}but Green Hills is a small town, it's a very small town.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:32.10,0:53:34.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,一点也不小啊 有几百号人呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not small. There are hundreds of people.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:34.72,0:53:36.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,这算是小镇子了 兄弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's a small town, dude.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:36.42,0:53:39.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是个完美的小镇 这里的人需要你\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a perfect town, and the people need you.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:39.18,0:53:40.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托 我做的事就是帮他们清理水沟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please, I clean up their gutters,
Dialogue: 0,0:53:40.83,0:53:42.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,帮他们在冬天启动车子\N{\fnArial\fs30}I jumpstart their cars in the winter.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:42.66,0:53:44.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们可以叫任何人去做这些事\N{\fnArial\fs30}They can call anybody to do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:44.47,0:53:46.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 他们是可以叫任何人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sure, they can call anybody,
Dialogue: 0,0:53:46.55,0:53:47.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,但他们没有 他们叫的是你\N{\fnArial\fs30}but the don't. They call you.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:20.85,0:54:22.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说的话一点道理也没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not making any sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:22.29,0:54:23.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能不能冷静下来啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Would you calm down?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:23.03,0:54:25.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,你生活在一个有着超赞居民的超赞的镇子\N{\fnArial\fs30}You come from a great town with great people,
Dialogue: 0,0:54:25.22,0:54:27.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且就我估计想杀死你的坏人数量为零\N{\fnArial\fs30}and by my count zero bad guys trying to kill you.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:30.13,0:54:32.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,再说 还有什么能比保护你在乎的人们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Besides, what could possibly be more important.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:32.74,0:54:35.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,更重要的事情呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}than protecting the people you care about?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:41.09,0:54:42.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 我懂你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, I get…
Dialogue: 0,0:54:44.43,0:54:45.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:53.03,0:54:55.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道吗 我看错你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what? I was wrong about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:55.05,0:54:56.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,你从来就不是什么甜甜圈殿下\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not the Donut Lord at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:56.83,0:54:58.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,你更像是一个混蛋殿下之类的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're more like the Jerk Lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:58.84,0:55:01.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,你难道没注意到有个鱼叉扎到了咱的车吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have you noticed the harpoon stuck in our dash?!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:07.43,0:55:08.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,索尼克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sonic!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:08.46,0:55:09.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我背井离乡是被迫的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was forced from my home,
Dialogue: 0,0:55:09.91,0:55:12.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,而你却自己要离开你那甜蜜的温柔乡\N{\fnArial\fs30}your home is perfect and you're leaving it.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:12.20,0:55:13.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为什么要那么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why would you do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:13.97,0:55:16.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你的身体怎么回事 - 不不 别又来了啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Your body! - No, no! Not again!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:16.53,0:55:18.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 抓紧了 - 为啥\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hey, hold on! - Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:18.45,0:55:19.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我要飙车了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because I'm gonna do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:38.41,0:55:39.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,索尼克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sonic!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:46.54,0:55:49.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我猜我应该是有额外的一条命吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guess I had a bonus life.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:51.57,0:55:52.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,帅呆了 宝贝儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, baby!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:52.96,0:55:55.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,索尼克对阵坦克 索尼克胜出\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sonic, one. Big tank, zero.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:55.47,0:55:57.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,不好意思 刚才这段被拍下来了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry. Did we get this on camera?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:57.43,0:55:59.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你怎么可能没死呢 - 我也不知道啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}- How are you not dead? - I have no idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:00.25,0:56:01.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你看到我跳的舞了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}But do you see me dancing?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:01.74,0:56:04.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 嗯 我看到你跳舞了 - 你就这点本事吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yes, I saw your dance. - Is that all you've got?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:04.40,0:56:06.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然不是 但谢谢你这么问\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, but thank you for asking.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:10.06,0:56:11.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,索尼克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sonic!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:11.61,0:56:14.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 快回到皮卡上来 - 你先走 我会跟上的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Get back in the truck! - You go, I'll catch up.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:25.39,0:56:27.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得那辆坦克好像生了个娃\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think that tank just had a baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:40.25,0:56:41.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,要被打到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Incoming!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:43.80,0:56:46.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 该我了 - 你才玩过一次 该我了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's my turn! - You just had one. It's mine!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:46.57,0:56:48.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,别打了 不然我就把它没收了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, stop fighting, or I'm taking that thing away!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:48.87,0:56:50.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 老爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, right, Dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:01.92,0:57:03.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你去哪 - 你好好开车\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Where are you going? - Just drive the car.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:04.08,0:57:05.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来处理那小坦克\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll take care of this.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:05.79,0:57:07.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我失败了 把我抛下离开就好\N{\fnArial\fs30}And if I don't make it, just ditch me,
Dialogue: 0,0:57:07.79,0:57:09.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,反正你挺擅长这么做的\N{\fnArial\fs30}you seem good at that.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:18.69,0:57:20.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈喽大家好 欢迎继续收看我的现场直播\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, everyone, welcome back to my livestream.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:20.96,0:57:23.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,今天我们来表演摧毁机器人 这是第一步\N{\fnArial\fs30}Today, we're destroying robots. Step one.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:28.37,0:57:29.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,太好了 我们做到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes! We did it!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:34.68,0:57:37.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们没做到 这家伙是谁啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}We did not do it. Who is this guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:37.61,0:57:39.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,你难道没想过你交的税都用到哪里了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ever wonder where your tax dollars are going?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:39.93,0:57:42.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,该我了 过来 让车保持笔直前行就好\N{\fnArial\fs30}My turn, here, just keep us going straight.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:42.62,0:57:43.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我开了定速巡航\N{\fnArial\fs30}I put on cruise control.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:44.22,0:57:46.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我感觉自己就像范·迪塞尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}I feel just like Vin Diesel.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:46.22,0:57:47.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,这都是为了家人 汤姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's all about family, Tom.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:55.04,0:57:56.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,小贴士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Quick suggestion.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:56.14,0:57:58.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,卷成一个球 滚动你的身体去撞它\N{\fnArial\fs30}Roll up into a ball and smash him with your body.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:00.06,0:58:02.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,天哪 你是怎么学的开车\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoa! Where'd you learn how to drive?!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:02.59,0:58:05.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就在这辆皮卡里面现学\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here, in this truck, it's happening as we speak.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:08.14,0:58:10.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我碰不到它 让我离它更近一点\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't reach it, bring it in closer.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:10.19,0:58:12.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你说啥 - 让我靠近一点 踩刹车\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What? - Bring it in closer. Hit the brakes.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:12.82,0:58:15.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你是说这个吗 - 另外一个踏板\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Oh, you mean this one? - The other brakes!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:30.15,0:58:33.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我好好歇会儿吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give me a big fat break!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:39.37,0:58:41.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个还挺可爱的 我们留着它吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}This one is cute, let's keep him.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:45.00,0:58:46.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,天哪 别这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:46.25,0:58:48.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么这么可爱的东西会这么吓人\N{\fnArial\fs30}How can something so adorable be so terrible.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:51.91,0:58:53.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你买车辆保险了 对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got car insurance, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:00.19,0:59:01.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,走开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Buzz off!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:02.01,0:59:03.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,这听上去不太妙\N{\fnArial\fs30}That doesn't sound good.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:03.19,0:59:04.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,不不不 哔哔声意味着非常不妙 快扔掉\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, beeping means bad! Get rid of it!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:04.81,0:59:05.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在试啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm trying.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:05.65,0:59:07.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,把它扔出去 扔哪儿都行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just throw it off the window! Throw it anywhere!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:07.75,0:59:10.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 粘住了弄不掉 - 好吧 那我靠边停车\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I can't get it off! - All right, I'm pulling over.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:17.69,0:59:19.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 弄掉了吗 - 没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Did I get it? - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:21.31,0:59:22.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我来 别动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here, hold still.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:23.64,0:59:25.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,扔掉了 它没了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's going. It's going.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:25.67,0:59:27.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,它还在\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's still here.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:30.17,0:59:33.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,给我下去 搞定\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get off me! Nailed it!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:43.05,0:59:44.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,索尼克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sonic!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:51.51,0:59:52.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:59.75,1:00:01.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,振作起来 你会没事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, come on. You're all right.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:01.62,1:00:03.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,醒醒 醒醒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wake up. Wake up.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:10.52,1:00:11.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们搞定他们了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did we get them?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:12.65,1:00:14.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 他们还在\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, no, there they are.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:14.79,1:00:17.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,这两个人真是福大命大\N{\fnArial\fs30}They are real survivors, those two.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:22.46,1:00:24.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们好好谈谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can we have a moment?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:26.69,1:00:28.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,自己把自己摁到墙上去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pin yourself to the wall.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:29.66,1:00:31.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是你消失了 我连想都不可能想起你\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, I won't miss you when you're gone.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:32.00,1:00:34.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,人类总是既狡猾又愚蠢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Human beings are unreliable and stupid,
Dialogue: 0,1:00:34.52,1:00:35.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我对他们不屑一顾\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I care very little about them.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:36.08,1:00:38.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我的机器却勤恳运作 残忍无情\N{\fnArial\fs30}But my machines are diligent, relentless.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:38.63,1:00:40.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们就是我的一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're everything to me!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:55.14,1:00:56.92,Note,0,0,0,0,,（真有趣）
Dialogue: 0,1:01:18.42,1:01:21.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,坚持住 伙计 你会没事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold on, buddy. You'll be all right.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:21.49,1:01:22.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会没事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll be all right.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:27.65,1:01:29.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 求求你 雷切尔 - 不 不 今天不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I beg you, Rachel. - No, no. Not today.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:29.18,1:01:30.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这次是紧急情况 - 再见\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No. It's an emergency. - Goodbye.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:30.31,1:01:30.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,走好不送\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bye bye.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:30.63,1:01:32.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 停下来听我说 开下门 玛蒂 - 再见\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Would you stop? Open it please. Maddie! - Bye. Bye.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:32.63,1:01:34.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,别这样 我有急事相求\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't do this to me please. It's important.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:34.23,1:01:35.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,汤姆 我的天啊 雷切尔放他进来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tom! Oh my God. Rachel let him in!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:35.93,1:01:36.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要报警 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am calling the Police. No,
Dialogue: 0,1:01:36.98,1:01:38.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要打给联邦调查局和中情局电话\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am calling the FBI. I am calling the CIA.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:38.72,1:01:40.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我要找人来 - 别叫人\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I am calling someone. - Don't do that.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:40.27,1:01:41.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我要给你妈妈打电话 - 好了好了 够了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm calling your Mother. - Okay. Got it.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:41.94,1:01:42.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,玛蒂 我们能不能\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maddie, can we just…
Dialogue: 0,1:01:42.87,1:01:43.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,汤姆 你这是演哪一出\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tom, what's going on?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:43.76,1:01:45.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,你都上新闻了 我还一直有给你打电话\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're all over the news. I've been trying to call you.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:46.00,1:01:47.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,为了防止被跟踪 我把手机扔了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had to ditch my phone so they couldn't track me.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:47.98,1:01:49.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 把手机扔了 - 跟踪 你\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Ditch his phone? - Track? You?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:49.33,1:01:51.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 汤姆叔叔 - 乔乔 你好啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Uncle Tommy! - Jojo! Hey.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:51.15,1:01:53.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 现在你侄女也成了叛国者从犯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now your niece is an accessory to treason.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:53.66,1:01:54.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,她不是从犯\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's not.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:54.53,1:01:57.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你能冷静点吗 - 冷静 我能冷静下来吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Would you calm down. - Calm down? I will not calm down!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:57.79,1:01:59.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了好了 冷静 都别说了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, calm down. Stop talking.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:59.15,1:02:01.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,别闹 奥兹 拜托 我见到你也很开心\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, Ozzy, please. I know, good to see you.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:01.35,1:02:04.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 别咬 松开 奥兹 住嘴 - 噢我的神啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No, no! Ozzy, stop! - Oh, good ol' Lord Baby Jesus!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:04.45,1:02:07.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,你抱着什么 汤姆 是钚还是机密邮件\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is that, Tom? Is it plutonium? Is it emails?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:07.29,1:02:08.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 就是钚元素\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, it's plutonium.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:08.27,1:02:10.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们能否 先去你房间然后再细谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can we just please… Can we just go to your room and talk…
Dialogue: 0,1:02:10.71,1:02:11.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,住嘴 奥兹 松开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop it, Ozzy! Quit it!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:11.95,1:02:13.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是我为什么说他很差劲\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is why I told you he was no good.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:13.68,1:02:14.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我根本没有了解\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not engaging…
Dialogue: 0,1:02:14.75,1:02:16.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 别 奥兹 松开 - 门现在倒是开得敞亮\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No, Ozzy, quit it! - Door now open.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:16.46,1:02:17.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我锁上了 - 不 你没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Locked. - No, it's unlocked.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:17.97,1:02:20.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,奥兹 不 奥兹 不 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ozzy, no! Ozzy! No, no!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:21.74,1:02:23.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,快来扶我一下 乔乔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, catch me, Jojo.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:25.24,1:02:26.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢天谢地\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, thank God!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:28.18,1:02:29.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能喝杯水吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can I get a glass of water?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:37.90,1:02:39.30,Note,0,0,0,0,,（无秩之音）
Dialogue: 0,1:03:12.72,1:03:15.78,Note,0,0,0,0,,（机器人 邪恶实验室）
Dialogue: 0,1:03:30.07,1:03:31.53,Note,0,0,0,0,,（样本检测完毕）
Dialogue: 0,1:03:38.62,1:03:41.10,Note,0,0,0,0,,（测量中 奎尔能量值）
Dialogue: 0,1:04:00.23,1:04:02.74,Note,0,0,0,0,,（正在确定 能量测量结果）
Dialogue: 0,1:04:10.62,1:04:12.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想 您也许想来杯\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just thought you might like.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:12.19,1:04:14.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,奥地利羊奶盖拿铁\N{\fnArial\fs30}a latte with steamed Austrian goat milk.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:14.56,1:04:16.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得我像什么 像个白痴吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do I look like, an imbecile?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:16.52,1:04:17.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我当然要喝拿铁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course, I want a latte!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:18.12,1:04:20.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还就喜欢你做的拿铁\N{\fnArial\fs30}I love the way you make them!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:23.64,1:04:26.09,Note,0,0,0,0,,（能量分析 无限）
Dialogue: 0,1:04:26.58,1:04:29.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,去备好原型机\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ready the prototype.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:29.51,1:04:31.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,有了这些能量\N{\fnArial\fs30}With this kind of power.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:31.17,1:04:34.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我这些机器的潜能终于能发挥到极致\N{\fnArial\fs30}my machines can finally reach their full potential.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:41.34,1:04:43.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,他会没事的 乔乔\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's gonna be okay, Jojo.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:44.59,1:04:46.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢天谢地 他会好起来的 对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, thank God. He's gonna be okay, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:47.23,1:04:48.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是个兽医 汤姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm a vet, Tom,
Dialogue: 0,1:04:48.07,1:04:49.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,而我甚至都不知道他是个什么物种\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't even know what I'm looking at here.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:50.10,1:04:52.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是只刺猬 至少他说自己是刺猬\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, he's a hedgehog… Or so he says.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:52.26,1:04:53.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他会说话吗 - 会 而且喋喋不休\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It talks? - Almost constantly.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:54.26,1:04:55.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:57.03,1:04:58.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 天啊 - 怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Holy… - What?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:58.29,1:04:59.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,他脉搏跳得非常快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Its pulse is super fast.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:00.05,1:05:02.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许 对他来说是正常的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, that actually might be normal for him.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:02.23,1:05:04.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也不知道 你得救救他 玛蒂\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know. You gotta help him, Maddie.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:04.20,1:05:05.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,可我都不知道他正常的生理体征\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know his physiology.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:05.66,1:05:08.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,好像没有骨折的迹象 只是\N{\fnArial\fs30}He doesn't seem to have any broken bones. He's just…
Dialogue: 0,1:05:09.47,1:05:11.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,他真的伤得很重\N{\fnArial\fs30}really banged up.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:12.30,1:05:14.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看他可怜的小脚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at his poor little feet.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:17.88,1:05:20.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,坚持住 伙计 你会没事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hang in there, buddy. You're gonna be all right.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:23.72,1:05:26.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,乔乔 快来给妈 乔乔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jojo, untie your Mo… Jojo!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:26.77,1:05:29.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,给妈妈松绑一下 亲爱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Untie Mommy. Sweetie.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:30.08,1:05:31.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,乔乔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jojo!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:34.10,1:05:35.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想上厕所\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have to go to the bathroom.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:35.86,1:05:37.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,他会没事的 对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's gonna be okay, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:37.70,1:05:40.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,他会好起来的 不久就会醒来是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like he's gonna snap outta this. He'll wake up soon.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:40.43,1:05:42.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 嗅盐 你应该有兽医用嗅盐之类的吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, smelling salts! Don't you have like vet smelling salts,
Dialogue: 0,1:05:42.87,1:05:45.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,比如给猫用的 或者给鹦鹉用的 之类的\N{\fnArial\fs30}like for cats, or parakeets or something?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:45.25,1:05:48.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不 没人生产猫嗅盐 - 为什么不生产呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No, they don't make cat smelling salts. - They should.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:48.60,1:05:52.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的 人用急救箱里 放了些人用嗅盐\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have human smelling salts in my human first aid kit.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:53.96,1:05:55.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:57.41,1:05:58.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托快醒来 伙计\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, buddy.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:58.70,1:06:00.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,要跑得快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gotta go fast!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:03.45,1:06:04.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在哪 今年是哪一年\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where am I? What year is it?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:04.76,1:06:05.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,巨石强森当总统了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is the Rock President?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:05.94,1:06:07.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,停 停 伙计 你没事了 冷静点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoa, whoa, buddy. You're okay. Calm down.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:08.02,1:06:10.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你好啊 椒盐卷饼夫人 - 你好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Oh, hi Pretzel Lady! - Hi.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:11.15,1:06:12.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,汤姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tom?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:12.32,1:06:14.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 怎么了 - 我能和你谈谈吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah? - Can I talk to you please?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:17.27,1:06:19.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,太空刺猬 待在那儿 尽量休息一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Space hedgehog, stay there. Try to rest.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:19.43,1:06:21.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,没问题 我最擅长休息了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got it. I am great at resting.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:21.22,1:06:22.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,论休息谁也比不过我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I rest better than anybody.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:23.02,1:06:24.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,还是说个不停\N{\fnArial\fs30}Still talking.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:24.53,1:06:27.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,首先 我们能花一点时间确认一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}First of all, can we take a moment to acknowledge.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:27.17,1:06:28.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我刚刚是不是很冷静\N{\fnArial\fs30}how under control I've been.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:28.28,1:06:29.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你很棒 - 没被吓坏\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Amazing. - Didn't freak out.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:29.76,1:06:31.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 没有 - 完全冷静\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No. - Totally calm.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:32.03,1:06:33.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:34.29,1:06:35.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,其次\N{\fnArial\fs30}Second of all,
Dialogue: 0,1:06:36.49,1:06:39.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,到底是怎么回事 他是个外星人吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}what the heck is going on?! Is that thing an alien?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:39.59,1:06:41.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,这么说吧 还记得疯狂的卡尔总是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, so, remember how Crazy Carl.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:41.76,1:06:44.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,对蓝恶魔那么疯狂吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}is always going on about the Blue Devil?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:44.88,1:06:46.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 原来是他 他是真的吗 - 对\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That's him. He's real? - Dah!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:47.12,1:06:49.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,那他来这里干什么 还有你又这里干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is he doing here? What are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:50.73,1:06:53.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我用你的麻醉枪击倒了这个蓝色的小朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}I kinda sorta shot our little blue friend with your tranq gun.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:54.01,1:06:56.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不 你不是吧 - 我不是 我不是故意的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No, you did not! - I didn't… I didn't mean to.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:56.43,1:06:58.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 解释清楚有点难\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, this is kinda hard for me to explain.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:58.55,1:07:00.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且听起来也有点疯狂\N{\fnArial\fs30}And it's gonna sound a little bit crazy.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:00.41,1:07:02.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,他得去泛美大厦\N{\fnArial\fs30}He has to get to the Transamerica building,
Dialogue: 0,1:07:02.33,1:07:03.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且我答应要带他去\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I promised I'd take him.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:05.09,1:07:06.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,外星人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aliens?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:06.49,1:07:08.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,玛蒂 你老公已经疯了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maddie, your husband's lost his mind.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:08.64,1:07:11.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,你正好利用这个机会赶紧离开他吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can use this as an opportunity to leave him.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:11.02,1:07:12.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家也都会理解你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}No one would judge you.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:17.25,1:07:19.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,穿这个 你就不会伤到你的脚了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you won't hurt your feet anymore.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:20.13,1:07:21.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:22.46,1:07:24.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,还从来没人送过我礼物呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}No one's ever given me a gift before.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:25.58,1:07:27.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得从把这一项从我的清单上去掉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I gotta check that off my bucket list.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:37.16,1:07:39.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,真棒 感觉很不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. Lookin' good.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:42.20,1:07:43.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:43.62,1:07:46.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说过 你想帮助真正有麻烦的人 对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You said you wanted to help people in real trouble, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:47.00,1:07:48.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也一直在这么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, that's what you're doing.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:48.57,1:07:52.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,那蓝色的外星人刺猬也算人 不是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Blue alien hedgehogs still count as people, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:52.23,1:07:53.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我也这么觉得 - 是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I think so, too. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:53.62,1:07:55.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 至少我觉得 - 好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I think. - Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:55.29,1:07:57.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我爱你 我记不得有没有告诉过你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I love you. Did I tell you that already?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:57.25,1:07:58.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我配不上你 你知道吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't deserve you, you know that?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:59.17,1:08:00.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know that.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:03.21,1:08:04.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以\N{\fnArial\fs30}So,
Dialogue: 0,1:08:04.30,1:08:06.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,你应该就是那个汤姆最好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}you're supposed to be Tom's best friend.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:06.32,1:08:07.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,绝不会拒之门外的朋友吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}that he won't shut up about.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:09.47,1:08:11.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,可我也看不出你哪里吸引他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I don't see the appeal.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:13.08,1:08:15.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,别舔了 这也太恶心了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop. That is very gross.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:19.06,1:08:20.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,是这样 我的卡车还能开\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, my truck still runs,
Dialogue: 0,1:08:20.73,1:08:22.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,但也将近面目全非了\N{\fnArial\fs30}but it's pretty much totaled.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:22.53,1:08:24.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说你姐姐会不会介意我们借她车一用\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think your sister would mind if we borrowed her car?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:24.86,1:08:26.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,你开什么玩笑\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have got to be kidding me!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:27.37,1:08:29.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 她会适应的 - 对 那走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- She'll be fine. - Yes, let's do that.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:29.95,1:08:32.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里是我家\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is my house!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:34.53,1:08:37.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我该转了 我这车开得左摇右摆的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now this is my turn. And I pull around him.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:37.97,1:08:40.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 完美刹车\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry. And… perfect park.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:40.79,1:08:41.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,你疯了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you, crazy?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:41.79,1:08:43.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,路上的东西怕是都被你撞过一遍了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is there anything you didn't hit?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:43.64,1:08:45.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们为什么要让外星人开车\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why did we let the alien drive?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:45.16,1:08:46.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,至少我开车还是把大家送到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, I got us here.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:46.56,1:08:48.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,麻烦给个五星好评\N{\fnArial\fs30}And please, five stars.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:49.66,1:08:51.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以 就是这了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, this is it?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:51.21,1:08:52.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是这儿 快看 你要的金字塔\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's it. That's your pyramid.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:53.39,1:08:56.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 快看 这擎天高楼 - 那接下来怎么办\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Wow! Look at that thing. - What happens now?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:57.36,1:08:59.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他 他跑了 - 对\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Oh, he's… gone. - Yup.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:01.19,1:09:03.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,没用 得要特定的钥匙才能到楼顶去\N{\fnArial\fs30}No good. You need a special key to get to the roof.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:04.87,1:09:06.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在怎么办\N{\fnArial\fs30}What now?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:06.61,1:09:09.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是时候滥用一次职权了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Time for me to abuse the power entrusted to me.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:19.66,1:09:21.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,楼顶有人想跳楼轻生\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got a jumper on the roof.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:21.16,1:09:22.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得尽快上去 免得\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gotta get up there fast, or we're gonna.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:22.93,1:09:24.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,待会就变成一个肉饼了\N{\fnArial\fs30}have a human pancake on our hands.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:24.66,1:09:26.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以 你从蒙大拿州一路赶来阻止他吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You came all the way from Montana?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:27.22,1:09:29.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 事态已经非常严重\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yup, that's how serious it is.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:33.88,1:09:35.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:36.64,1:09:38.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,你刚刚挽救了一条生命\N{\fnArial\fs30}You just saved a life.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:41.72,1:09:43.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,快啊 快啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:46.90,1:09:49.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,还要多久啊 这里面根本呼吸不了\N{\fnArial\fs30}How much longer? I can't breathe in here.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:51.72,1:09:54.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好 有人吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello? Anybody there?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:54.18,1:09:56.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是把你的孩子装进了这个包里吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you have your child in that bag?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:56.36,1:09:57.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:57.67,1:10:00.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是说 是的 是个孩子 但不是我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean yes, it's a child, but it's not mine.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:01.24,1:10:02.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是你的孩子吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not your child?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:02.98,1:10:05.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,别紧张 我是警察 好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Relax, I'm a cop, okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:05.14,1:10:06.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且他也喜欢待在包里 是吧 伙计\N{\fnArial\fs30}Plus he likes it in there, don't you, buddy?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:07.10,1:10:08.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我为什么会想待在包里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why would I like it in here?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:08.54,1:10:11.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,这包还不如你之前关我的狗笼呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is worse than the dog cage you had me in earlier.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:12.14,1:10:13.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是孩子气\N{\fnArial\fs30}Such a kidder.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:14.89,1:10:16.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:16.41,1:10:19.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要啊 我怕黑 有人在吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I'm scared of the dark! Is anybody there?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:32.24,1:10:34.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的包都用来装些什么啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}What were you keeping in this bag?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:34.59,1:10:36.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要在里面腌一罐臭屁吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}A jar of pickled farts?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:36.48,1:10:38.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 好吧 所以要在这儿找什么东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, all right, what are we looking for?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:41.31,1:10:42.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}This!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:43.05,1:10:45.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 然后呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, what happens now?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:45.29,1:10:46.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在 我要做的就是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, all I have to do is think of.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:46.62,1:10:48.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,想想让戒指的另一边出现在什么地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}where I want the other end of the ring to appear,
Dialogue: 0,1:10:48.83,1:10:50.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 然后把戒指扔出去 - 就这样吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- and I throw it. - So, that's it?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:50.90,1:10:52.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们做到了吗 - 对 我们做到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We did it? - Yeah. We did it.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:53.55,1:10:55.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 没能把你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, sorry we didn't get to do everything.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:55.31,1:10:57.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,愿望清单上的事都挨件做完 伙计\N{\fnArial\fs30}on your bucket list, pal.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:57.20,1:11:00.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事的 我做到了其中我最想做的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's okay. I did the ones I needed the most.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:00.96,1:11:04.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你们俩真可爱 就像 - 拜托 你说啥\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You two are so cute, like… - Oh, please. What?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:04.80,1:11:06.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们才不可爱 - 不 我们一点都不可爱\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We are not. - No, we're not cute.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:06.98,1:11:08.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们俩都只会我行我素\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are a couple of loose cannons.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:08.62,1:11:10.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,按自己的规则来生活\N{\fnArial\fs30}just living by our own rules.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:10.24,1:11:11.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 没错 是的 - 真的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Exactly. Yeah. - Really?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:11.92,1:11:15.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,诉说一些真挚的情感也是我们的规则\N{\fnArial\fs30}And our rules include expressing heartfelt emotions.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:15.23,1:11:16.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 听你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you say so.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:16.63,1:11:18.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,那好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay then.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:18.42,1:11:19.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:20.55,1:11:22.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你得走了 是吗 - 对 我得走了 所以\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You gotta go, right? - Yeah, I gotta go, so…
Dialogue: 0,1:11:22.67,1:11:24.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得走了 我们也得走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I gotta go. We gotta go, too.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:24.22,1:11:25.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以 这样的话 好吧 再见\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, see… All right. Bye bye.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:30.03,1:11:31.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有一件事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just one more thing.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:39.74,1:11:41.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起 我对你要求太多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry I was so hard on you.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:44.32,1:11:45.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道 选择离开青山镇\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know it's a tough decision.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:45.91,1:11:47.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,对你来说挺不容易\N{\fnArial\fs30}for you to leave Green Hills.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:47.52,1:11:50.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,离开你在乎的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Walking away from something you care about.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:50.69,1:11:52.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,一定很痛苦\N{\fnArial\fs30}has to be painful.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:52.51,1:11:54.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不太确定你是不是真的想走 对吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not sure you really wanna go, huh?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:55.39,1:11:58.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不想走 但我也不能留在原地\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't wanna go, but I can't stay.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:58.83,1:12:01.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要我在这儿 大家就都不安全\N{\fnArial\fs30}As long as I'm here I put everyone in danger.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:01.98,1:12:03.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不能置大家于险地\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't do that.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:04.41,1:12:07.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只想让你知道 这两天\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just want you to know that these last two days.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:07.26,1:12:11.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我生命中最美好的两天\N{\fnArial\fs30}have been the best two days of my life.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:14.08,1:12:15.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也知道 我从来不会把思念挂在嘴边\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know I never though I'd say this.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:15.88,1:12:18.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我真的会想你的 你这个蓝恶魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I'm actually gonna miss you, you little Blue Devil.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:18.54,1:12:20.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也会想你的 甜甜圈殿下\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll miss you too, Donut Lord.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:21.42,1:12:22.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:23.29,1:12:24.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么谢我\N{\fnArial\fs30}For what?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:25.20,1:12:26.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为你救了我的命\N{\fnArial\fs30}For saving my life.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:44.77,1:12:47.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人开着「查找我的手机」吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, did someone leave their 'Find my Phone' on?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:13.97,1:13:17.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,欢迎来到旧金山瓦查斯基先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Welcome to San Francisco, Mr. Wachowski.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:17.71,1:13:19.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,你喜欢吃蛤蜊杂烩吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you enjoying the clam chowder?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:19.66,1:13:22.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,原来一直想杀我们的是为政府打零工的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's the government wack job who keeps trying to kill us,
Dialogue: 0,1:13:22.20,1:13:23.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,可惜没有得手\N{\fnArial\fs30}unsuccessfully.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:23.43,1:13:25.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,感谢你在去动漫展的路上顺路过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nice of you to swing by on your way to Comic-Con.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:25.64,1:13:27.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 你穿的是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, what are you wearing?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:28.67,1:13:30.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是飞行服\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a flight suit.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:30.33,1:13:32.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,它的设计可以调节我的体温 减少阻力\N{\fnArial\fs30}Designed to modulate my body temperature and reduce drag.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:33.22,1:13:35.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 但你仍然像个漫展的工作人员\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, and yet you're still are one.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:35.53,1:13:38.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,好样的 托马斯你是在引火烧身\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good one, you are catching fire, Thomas.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:38.76,1:13:41.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,说到火 我看你带了个情人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, and speaking of heat, I see you've taken a lover.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:41.81,1:13:42.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,她有名字吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Does she have a name,
Dialogue: 0,1:13:42.54,1:13:45.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,或者我们要叫她「被伤及的无辜」\N{\fnArial\fs30}or should we just call her 'collateral damage'?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:45.58,1:13:46.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂 别乱说话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, watch your mouth!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:46.94,1:13:49.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,除非你想被打得比之前更惨\N{\fnArial\fs30}Unless you want a little more of what I gave you earlier?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:49.49,1:13:50.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,一拳打到他脸上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Punched him in the face.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:50.69,1:13:53.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,你直接一拳打到他脸上 太棒了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, you punched him right in the face. It was awesome.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:53.20,1:13:56.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,闲聊时间结束了 该按下按钮了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The time for talking is over! It's time to push buttons.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:56.23,1:13:58.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的会飞的蛋真是让人印象深刻\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your flying eggs are pretty impressive,
Dialogue: 0,1:13:58.04,1:13:59.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,蛋人先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Eggman.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:59.29,1:14:01.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,但面对现实吧 你永远抓不到我\N{\fnArial\fs30}But let's face it, you'll never catch me.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:01.86,1:14:03.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,自信\N{\fnArial\fs30}Confidence,
Dialogue: 0,1:14:03.67,1:14:05.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,是智慧的一个愚蠢的替代\N{\fnArial\fs30}a fool's substitute for intelligence.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:13.43,1:14:15.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,这下糟了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's not good.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:15.50,1:14:18.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,索尼克 我知道你有超高的速度\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sonic, I know you got the super speed and everything,
Dialogue: 0,1:14:18.06,1:14:18.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,但玛蒂和我\N{\fnArial\fs30}but Maddie and I…
Dialogue: 0,1:14:18.83,1:14:20.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,毫无防御能力 可能会被炸飞\N{\fnArial\fs30}Totally defenseless, probably gonna get blown up?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:21.09,1:14:22.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,差不多是这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pretty much, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:22.97,1:14:25.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,别担心 我知道该怎么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't worry, I know exactly what to do.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:32.89,1:14:34.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,这招我没想到\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was not expecting that.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:35.15,1:14:37.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我本就想什么都不想\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I was expecting not to expect something,
Dialogue: 0,1:14:37.14,1:14:38.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以这不算数\N{\fnArial\fs30}so it doesn't count.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:38.65,1:15:39.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,加油\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:40.03,1:15:42.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,加油加油\N{\fnArial\fs30}Com… Com… Come on! Come on!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:08.70,1:16:11.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨 汤姆 很高兴你来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi Tom. Glad you're here.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:11.31,1:16:14.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,快来帮忙 老贝西要生产了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Could use some help. Old Bessie is about to give birth.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:15.19,1:16:16.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,给我一分钟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give me a minute.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:19.25,1:16:22.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能给你一个天才的建议吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can I give you one genius piece of advice?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:22.95,1:16:24.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要跑了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't run.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:24.50,1:16:26.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,跑只会带来更多痛苦\N{\fnArial\fs30}It'll only hurt more if you do.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:26.87,1:16:29.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,并且科学证明 它对你的关节有害\N{\fnArial\fs30}And it's bad for your joints, they proved it.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:29.38,1:16:30.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 蛋人\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, Eggman,
Dialogue: 0,1:16:30.50,1:16:33.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想要快吗 那就快开始吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}you wanna get fast? Let's get fast.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:36.10,1:16:37.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,困难模式开始\N{\fnArial\fs30}The hard way it is.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:56.75,1:16:59.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,顺便说一句 那个左转违章了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was an illegal left, by the way.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:01.31,1:17:03.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以 我们又回到了这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, here we are again.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:03.28,1:17:05.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们一起经历了那么多\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've been through so much together.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:05.12,1:17:07.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在你明白 为什么有个变态机械博士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now you understand why there's a psychotic robot-doctor.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:07.84,1:17:10.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,在追逐一只超音速蓝色刺猬了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}chasing a super sonic blue hedgehog.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:10.09,1:17:11.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,想知道结局是怎样的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wanna know how it ends?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:11.51,1:17:12.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 我也想知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, me too.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:30.38,1:17:33.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么可能 从来没人追上过我\N{\fnArial\fs30}How is this possible?! No one's ever caught up to me before.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:41.57,1:17:43.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我过来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Coming through!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:46.01,1:17:47.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,请原谅我 先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excusez-moi, monsieur.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:51.90,1:17:54.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,有了 有地方可以打开它了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here we go. Room to open it up.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:03.43,1:18:04.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我甩不掉他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't lose him!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:19.28,1:18:21.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你打不过他 就弄瞎他\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you can't beat him, blind him.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:24.94,1:18:26.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,无法视觉探测\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lost visual contact.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:31.69,1:18:33.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不准爬上那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not allowed up there!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:33.90,1:18:36.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是世界七大奇迹之一\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's one of the Seven Wonders.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:59.97,1:19:02.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 快跑 - 快点 快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Get out of here! - Go! Go!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:09.51,1:19:12.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真是个了不起的小东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're an astonishing little creature.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:15.20,1:19:17.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,把你带回实验室\N{\fnArial\fs30}It'll be fun to take you back to the lab.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:17.36,1:19:19.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,进行一系列有创的探索性手术会很有趣的\N{\fnArial\fs30}for a litany of invasive exploratory procedures.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:20.56,1:19:22.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,有什么遗言吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Any last words?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:23.06,1:19:24.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,呱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guac.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:24.72,1:19:26.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我喜欢这个词\N{\fnArial\fs30}I like that word.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:27.29,1:19:29.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不用告诉你 有多少科学突破\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't have to tell you how many scientific breakthroughs.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:29.90,1:19:32.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,是通过动物实验实现的\N{\fnArial\fs30}have been made possible by animal testing.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:32.39,1:19:33.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,你太自私了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're being very selfish.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:33.88,1:19:35.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 挡我路了 - 什么鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Going my way? - What the…
Dialogue: 0,1:19:41.31,1:19:43.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,你以为你是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who the hell do you think you are?!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:46.56,1:19:48.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是甜甜圈殿下 你个智障\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm the Donut Lord, you son of a…
Dialogue: 0,1:19:53.14,1:19:55.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,自动飞行 调整\N{\fnArial\fs30}Autopilot, adjust.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:55.72,1:19:56.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:57.26,1:20:00.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为什么要为这东西放弃你的生命\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why would you throw your life away for this thing?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:00.61,1:20:02.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,因此我从不交朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's why I don't have friends.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:02.31,1:20:04.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,不然接下来你就会当上某人的伴郎\N{\fnArial\fs30}Next thing you know, you're somebody's best man,
Dialogue: 0,1:20:04.46,1:20:06.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们想在城外举行婚礼\N{\fnArial\fs30}they wanna have the wedding out of town.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:06.33,1:20:08.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,好像没人有什么正事可干\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like nobody has anything better to do!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:08.62,1:20:10.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,总之 刚才我们说到哪儿了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anyway, where were we?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:10.84,1:20:11.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,对了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, yes,
Dialogue: 0,1:20:12.12,1:20:13.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就快死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}you were about to die.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:15.79,1:20:17.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,你惹的是我们的警长\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's our Sheriff you're messing with.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:19.23,1:20:20.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,以及我们的蓝恶魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}And our Blue Devil?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:21.08,1:20:24.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家都看到了 它是个真实存在的生物\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who as everyone can see is a very real creature,
Dialogue: 0,1:20:24.49,1:20:27.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,完全不是我胡扯出来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}and not at all invented by me!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:29.63,1:20:31.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 小心点 - 只是 把它挪远一点\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Be careful. - Just… pull it away…
Dialogue: 0,1:20:31.75,1:20:32.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,汤姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tom.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:46.24,1:20:48.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不想在这里无礼\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't mean to be indelicate here.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:48.34,1:20:51.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,但有人应该拿些冰来 别让它身体腐烂\N{\fnArial\fs30}But someone should get some ice to keep the body fresh.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:54.70,1:20:57.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,他只是个愚蠢的小外星人\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's just a silly little alien.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:57.58,1:20:59.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,他不属于这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}He didn't belong here!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:01.06,1:21:02.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个小外星人\N{\fnArial\fs30}That little alien.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:03.26,1:21:06.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,比你更懂得做人\N{\fnArial\fs30}knew more about being human than you ever will.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:07.46,1:21:09.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,他叫索尼克\N{\fnArial\fs30}His name was Sonic.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:09.70,1:21:11.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是他的家\N{\fnArial\fs30}This was his home.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:12.10,1:21:13.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是我的朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}And he was my friend.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:38.64,1:21:40.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是你的了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's all yours.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:41.55,1:21:42.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家都退后\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everyone get back!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:46.45,1:21:49.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想你拿了属于我的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think you have something that belongs to me.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:00.05,1:22:01.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我的力量\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is my power!
Dialogue: 0,1:22:02.15,1:22:04.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我再也不会用它逃跑了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I'm not using it to run away anymore.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:04.74,1:22:08.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要用它来保护我的朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm using it to protect my friends!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:06.54,1:23:07.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在你做到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now you've done it!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:08.05,1:23:09.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你猜怎么着 蛋人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guess what, Eggman,
Dialogue: 0,1:23:09.20,1:23:10.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是不会离开地球的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not leaving Earth.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:10.92,1:23:12.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,你才是要离开的那个\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:12.43,1:23:13.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,甜甜圈殿下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Donut Lord?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:02.64,1:24:05.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我就说你能成功 - 是我们能成功\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Told you you got this. - Hey, we got this.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:18.02,1:24:20.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这些是你的 - 非常感谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}- These belong to you. - Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:21.49,1:24:23.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,不许再把人从楼上推下去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No more pushing people of the buildings.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:23.68,1:24:25.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道我不能保证\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know I can't promise that.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:28.38,1:24:29.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,你做得很好 太空刺猬\N{\fnArial\fs30}You did pretty good, space hog.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:30.08,1:24:31.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢夸奖 甜甜圈殿下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks, Donut Lord.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:31.63,1:24:34.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,你得讲讲「甜甜圈殿下」的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're gonna have to explain this 'Donut Lord' thing.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:34.62,1:24:35.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不好意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nope, sorry,
Dialogue: 0,1:24:35.86,1:24:37.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我和这小家伙之间的故事 对吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}that's for me and the little guy. Right?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:37.47,1:24:39.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们有我们的故事 你有你和\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got our thing, you got your thing with your…
Dialogue: 0,1:24:39.62,1:24:41.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你妹妹的故事 - 天啊 我的妹妹\N{\fnArial\fs30}- sister. - Oh my God, my sister.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:41.51,1:24:43.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要更快 我要更快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gotta go fast. Gotta go fast.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:45.60,1:24:47.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,乔乔 戴上我的智能手环\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jojo, put on my Fitbit.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:48.45,1:24:50.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,那样我至少多刷点步数\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then I can at least get some steps.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:50.42,1:24:51.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们再也不能回去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can never go back there.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:53.13,1:24:53.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的不能了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, are we?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:56.69,1:24:59.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为感觉我们现在就在家\N{\fnArial\fs30}'Cause it kinda feels like we're home right now.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:59.58,1:25:01.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:02.46,1:25:04.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得我已经完成了我的清单上\N{\fnArial\fs30}I kinda feel like I checked the 'save the life'
Dialogue: 0,1:25:05.08,1:25:06.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,「拯救生命」的那一项\N{\fnArial\fs30}box off my bucket list.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:09.40,1:25:10.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在我只想\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now all I wanna do.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:11.06,1:25:13.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,和我关心的人共度一生\N{\fnArial\fs30}is to spend my life with the people I care about.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:14.65,1:25:16.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想完成那一项\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wanna check that box.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:17.16,1:25:19.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,好呀 我喜欢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. I like that.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:19.34,1:25:21.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了各位 没什么好看的了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, everybody. Nothing to see here.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:22.44,1:25:23.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,散了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Disperse.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:23.36,1:25:25.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是青山镇普通的一天\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just another ordinary day in Green Hills.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:25.26,1:25:27.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡尔 我要没收那个电锯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Carl, I'll take that chainsaw.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:27.38,1:25:29.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点 我们走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, let's go!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:29.36,1:25:31.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们要表现得好像从没见过一场\N{\fnArial\fs30}You act like you've never seen a fight between.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:31.52,1:25:35.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,星际啮齿动物和博士机器人间的战斗\N{\fnArial\fs30}an intergalactic space rodent and a robot with a doctorate.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:44.77,1:25:46.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,你那里的油漆够用吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got enough there?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:46.50,1:25:48.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 够了 包工头先生 - 要再来点吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yes, Mr. Manager. - You need any more?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:48.79,1:25:50.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,你明知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}You get that…boy…
Dialogue: 0,1:26:00.78,1:26:02.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,瓦查斯基夫妇吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. And Mrs. Wachowski?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:03.44,1:26:04.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,有什么事情吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:06.84,1:26:08.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里有份政府发来的奖励\N{\fnArial\fs30}A token of appreciation from your government.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:09.11,1:26:12.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,表彰您对最近发生的未发生之事保持沉默\N{\fnArial\fs30}For keeping quiet about recent incidents, which never occurred.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:16.13,1:26:18.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不知道里面是什么 - 修房子的钱吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Wonder what it is. - Money to fix the house?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:18.81,1:26:21.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 总统的信吗 - 你看了就知道了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Letter from the President? - You'll see.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:21.50,1:26:22.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:24.30,1:26:25.78,Note,0,0,0,0,,（瓦查斯基一家 山姆大叔）
Dialogue: 0,1:26:25.90,1:26:28.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 橄榄园 - 是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Olive Garden? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:28.40,1:26:29.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像你说的「看了就知道了」\N{\fnArial\fs30}The way you said "you'll see"
Dialogue: 0,1:26:30.10,1:26:32.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我觉得这比我们说的要好\N{\fnArial\fs30}made me think it was something better than the things we said.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:32.81,1:26:35.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,你试过他们的「吃不完的意面碗」吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have you tried their 'Never Ending Pasta Bowl'?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:35.25,1:26:36.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,永远吃不完\N{\fnArial\fs30}It never ends.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:37.10,1:26:38.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,听起来很棒\N{\fnArial\fs30}That sounds fancy.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:39.04,1:26:41.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你 我们很感激你们的好意\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, thank you. We appreciate the gesture.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:42.42,1:26:45.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我猜罗伯特尼克的档案可以销毁了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, hey, I guess we can close the file on that Robotnik guy, huh?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:45.73,1:26:47.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,他就这么消失了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just disappeared?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:47.28,1:26:50.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很抱歉 但没有这样的人存在\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry, but, no such person exists,
Dialogue: 0,1:26:50.22,1:26:51.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,也不曾存在过这样的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}or ever has existed.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:52.39,1:26:53.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我希望那事是真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wish that were true.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:53.75,1:26:55.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们那件事过后 就再也没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}You haven't by any chance been in contact.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:55.75,1:26:58.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,和那个外星人的联系了对吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}with a certain alien creature since the incident, have you?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:58.49,1:27:00.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,山姆大叔很想和他聊聊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uncle Sam would love to have a chat with him.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:00.57,1:27:02.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,很随意的聊天 早午餐就可以\N{\fnArial\fs30}Very casual, brunch perhaps.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:04.53,1:27:07.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是说那个蓝色的小家伙吗 没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, you mean the little blue guy? No, no. Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:08.57,1:27:10.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,恐怕我们再也听不到他的消息了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Doubt we'll ever hear from him again.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:12.11,1:27:14.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 很好 - 好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Very well. - Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:14.79,1:27:16.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 谢谢 - 太好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Thank you. - Great.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:18.86,1:27:20.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yup.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:23.39,1:27:26.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,说实话 我对那个意面碗很感兴趣\N{\fnArial\fs30}To be honest, I'm pretty pumped about the pasta bowl.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:26.61,1:27:28.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们想看电影吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, you guys wanna watch a movie or what?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:28.61,1:27:30.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉伙计 今天是上学之夜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry, buddy, it's a school night,
Dialogue: 0,1:27:30.04,1:27:31.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,你该回你的小窝去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}it's time for you to go back to your cave.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:31.97,1:27:33.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么 才下午三点\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? It's three in the afternoon!
Dialogue: 0,1:27:33.72,1:27:35.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道当你累的时候你会变成什么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know how you get when you're tired, come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:35.77,1:27:37.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我吗 我不会变成什么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Me? I'm not like anything.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:37.39,1:27:40.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你们真不酷 - 是的 我们知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You guys are so uncool. - Yeah, yeah. We know.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:41.04,1:27:42.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 伙计 你要去哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, buddy, where are you going?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:42.12,1:27:44.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说的 我得回我的小窝\N{\fnArial\fs30}You said I have to go back to my cave.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:44.47,1:27:45.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们是这么说的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We did.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:00.58,1:28:03.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊 你在开玩笑吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh my… Are you kidding me?
Dialogue: 0,1:28:04.31,1:28:05.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,真不敢相信\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't believe it.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:06.27,1:28:07.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么\N{\fnArial\fs30}How did you…
Dialogue: 0,1:28:08.20,1:28:10.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,它 这是 所有的东西都在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}It… This is… It's all here.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:20.72,1:28:22.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看这个 你在开玩笑吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at this! Are you kidding?
Dialogue: 0,1:28:22.38,1:28:23.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有懒人沙发 不会是真的吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the bean bag? No way!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:24.56,1:28:27.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么弄到这个的 这一切怎么搞到的\N{\fnArial\fs30}How did you even get this? How did you get it all over?
Dialogue: 0,1:28:28.14,1:28:30.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我爱死它了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I love it, I love it!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:33.57,1:28:36.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,欢迎回家\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, welcome home.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:36.55,1:28:39.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,非常感谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you so much.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:47.86,1:28:49.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不可以\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, no, you don't.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:49.51,1:28:52.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,人类第二好的动物朋友不许进我的房间\N{\fnArial\fs30}No second best animal friends allowed in my room.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:53.02,1:28:55.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 你在干什么 离我远点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait, what are you doing? Stay away from me.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:55.71,1:28:58.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,停下 我警告你 我可有双截棍\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop it. I'm warning you, I've got nunchucks.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:58.58,1:29:01.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 住手 好吧 你可以待在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, stop. Okay, you can stay.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:04.78,1:29:08.78,Title,0,0,0,0,,《刺猬索尼克》
Dialogue: 0,1:29:18.43,1:29:21.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我仍然保持着绝对的理智\N{\fnArial\fs30}My grasp on sanity remains absolute.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:23.58,1:29:25.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不对 石头特工\N{\fnArial\fs30}Isn't that right, Agent Stone?
Dialogue: 0,1:29:30.22,1:29:32.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为什么不先去探探路呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why don't you get a head start.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:34.46,1:29:36.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,做点石学研究\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do some rockconnaissance.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:37.68,1:29:40.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,石学 这太搞笑了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rockconnaissance. Come on, that's hilarious.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:40.58,1:29:42.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's the matter with you?!
Dialogue: 0,1:29:42.71,1:29:46.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,情况如下 一个无人居住的星球\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here's the sitch. Uninhabited planet.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:47.40,1:29:49.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有资源 没有补给\N{\fnArial\fs30}No resources. No supplies.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:49.92,1:29:51.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有回家的路\N{\fnArial\fs30}No apparent way home.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:53.82,1:29:56.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个无能的男人会死在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}A lesser man would die here.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:58.66,1:30:00.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,而我会在圣诞节前回家\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll be home by Christmas.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:19.82,1:30:22.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,石学\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rockconnaissance!
Dialogue: 0,1:30:25.12,1:30:26.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,加油 振作起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, cheer up!
Dialogue: 0,1:32:29.08,1:32:31.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果这些读数准确 他就在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}If these readings are accurate, he's here.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:31.67,1:32:32.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我找到他了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I found him!
Dialogue: 0,1:32:33.13,1:32:34.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是希望我没来晚\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just hope I'm not too late.
